<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Tue Jan 14 2025 15:54:12 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Romans</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Rô-ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rô-ma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt">Rô-ma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Phaau-lô, dhơn ratơơq ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih mưi sưưq-đô bâân dhaloong kayua, bâân palalei đóng Taruuih Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />nek rau hơq Ađó ơi hươq tââq n'loom dhiq nôôq manưih loom đââng taruuih ưng Ađó kalóóng Bha-aar Paraaq Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />leq Akóón Ađó — Yaang bâân yuur n'niên tââq dhong nooi ưng Đa-viit ting kơi achak araang. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Yaang bâân đóók dhalam nek Akóón Yaang Pleng tââq mataai raman dhiq rau mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt ting Yaang Liêm sek tabah — hơq nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih Chuôq nôôq he, <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />hơq đươi Ađó, nôôq yi ơi pei đơơp phươk liêm lơq tarnêêng sưưq-đô pơh tơk rau xâng bóóp ưng lóóm huuiq dhiq m'pơng tabhơt nôôq dhanuôr manưih katiêk lââng, ơi taai dhanóók Ađó, <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />kalóóng nôôq ađek adhi anó kung nek nôôq manưih bâân dhaloong kayua mađó leq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Pagơơi tơk tabhơt nôôq ngaai xók tơơt dhiq Rô-ma, nek nôôq manưih bơk nh'nhơr ưng Yaang Pleng, nek nôôq manưih huuiq bâân dhaloong: Nhan phươk liêm tơk palơq adhi anó palơq yươq rauha tââq Yaang Pleng, Ama nôôq he, lơq tââq Chuôq, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Laloom bhơt, đươi Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, aku ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng ưng aku leq tabhơt adhi anó, taai lóóm huuiq ưng adhi anó, bâân yuur truuih plok tabhơt talaang katiêk. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Taai Yaang Pleng, nek manưih truuih ưng aku, Yaang hơq aku têêng yaauq palơq lóóm karnóq ađêi kalóóng taruuih liêm ưng Akóón Ađó, achêk nek aku kah katơng ve rau praaq pahei leq adhi anó n'đó alua, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />xók taluôn luôn mââl nhan kalóóng paraaq gavơh nhan ưng ađêi kơi la ve chóóm bâân, buôn hayơq mót bhêêl đôk môôiq bhêêl lââng, aku e ve jal vôôiq liêm kre tââq kanóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng buôn tơk palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Taai aku rââm mamââk bâân lum adhi anó, hơq đóng aku ve chóóm paak blah palơq adhi anó ve ađó ơơn phươk liêm mak ađó, buôn adhi anó bâân mưng karơ, <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />hơq tarnêêng ađek nek buôn aku kung bâân têêng tabhơơl palơq adhi anó, đươi rau tơơt kalóóng ting chanak, hơq nek lóóm huuiq ưng tabhơt adhi anó lơq aku. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Nhan móón adhi anó, aku kah kiêng adhi anó kah bâân n'nal kơi bơk chu aku ơi ve kanóq kaniêng tơk palơq adhi anó (hơq aku ơi bâân takajơq patơk bhêêl đôk), hơq đóng aku kung ve chóóm xóót leh yưưm n'đó ađek dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, kung kơi m'pơng nôôq dhanuôr manưih katiêk lââng. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Aku nek manưih manơơq miq manưih Hi-laap palơq manưih kah ve tabech, tabhơt manưih tabech galang palơq manưih ngôôk ngaak. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Kơi chêk hayơq, ting kơi palơq aku, alua nek puih lóóm buôn kung truuih karơ Taruuih Liêm đóng adhi anó, nek nôôq manưih dhiq Rô-ma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Taai aku yươq kachiit mat leq taruuih liêm, tââq ađek nek mataai raman ưng Yaang Pleng buôn rau paq jóói pakoom đóng tabhơt nôôq ngaai huuiq, hơq nek pakoom laloom tââm đóng manưih Jo Thaaiq, palơq pakoom đóng manưih Hi-laap. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Tââq rau bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, bâân tapakah kalóóng Taruuih Liêm ađek, tââq lóóm huuiq tơk lóóm huuiq, kơi ơi bâân xaraq kơi ađô: “Nôôq manưih bhơt liêm e mamông tââq lóóm huuiq.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Taai ganơt pagrâ janah ưng Yaang Pleng tââq pleng bâân tapakah makhich palơq dyóp rau kah huuiq lơq rau môôp lơt ưng palââng, nek nôôq manưih têêng tamôôp paraaq dhalam kalóóng rau kah liêm, <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />taai rau bâân n'nal leq Yaang Pleng nek drêh dróói dhiq m'pơng piđó, tââq Yaang Pleng ơi tapakah rau ađek leq piđó. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Taai tââq xók tââp tavaaih pleng katiêk, nôôq rau kah chóóm lêi ưng Ađó, hơq nek miq mataai karơ palơq Yaang karnóq tơk nh'chró ưng Ađó, maar bâân đơơp n'nal drêh dróói, xók bâân chóóm n'nal rau dhiq nôôq tarnêêng tavaaih ưng Ađó, buôn đóng piđó kah ve rau chóóm dyiin. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Achêk nek Taai dhơ đơơp n'nal Yaang Pleng, piđó ơi kah bhuôih haanh Ađó nek Yaang Pleng, kung kah ma-ơơn Ađó. Klóóih dhiq ađek, piđó ơi val kơi kah malơơi kalóóng nôôq karnóq ađêi, lơq lóóm kah vaaih kanóq ưng piđó ơi bâân rau kanam kadhiiq jađơr pađơp. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Xók tư móón nek tabech galang, piđó ơi pakah ađêi ngôôk ngaak, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />lơq piđó ơi raxal cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng kah bil palơq kơi kiêng thê leq dyaang a-ô ưng akóón manưih chêt bil, kung kơi ưng achim, adhah, lơq rau tatơ.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Đóng hayơq, Yaang Pleng ơi pajaau mak kơi piđó leq nôôq malóóch kiêng ưng lóóm ađêi malóóm tơk leq rau kah sek tabah, buôn achak araang piđó bâân têêng takađiq dhiq m'pơng kabhuh piđó, <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />hơq nek nôôq manưih ơi raxal paraaq dhalam ưng Yaang Pleng palơq rau galơơk chachââr, lơq ơi bhuôih haanh palơq têêng yaauq kabhêi paklóóih đóng Yaang Tââp Tavaaih, nek Yaang đaang bâân bhi haanh patơk nh'chró. A-meen.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ơi taai kơi ađek, Yaang Pleng ơi pajaau mak kơi piđó đóng nôôq malóóch kiêng nhơơp xrơơm, ơi nôôq manưih pađiil ưng piđó ơi raxal kơi bêch tơơt kaxu xar lơt kơi kaxu, <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />kung kơi ađek, manưih padruuih kung thê kơi ađek, xong xók m'peq lơơi kơi bêch tơơt kaxu palơq manưih pađiil, nek đơơp puih chahaang kalóóng lóóm takiêng ưng piđó leq xóng piđó, bhêêl padruuih palơq padruuih têêng chiên kah matich, hayơq đơơp lóóiq dhiq chênh ađêi kala rau janah, nek rau glap palơq tarnêêng lơt môôp ưng piđó.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kung ting kơi hơq piđó ơi kah chamet lêi phaai ve Yaang Pleng kalóóng karnóq ađêi nek liêm kre, nek Yaang Pleng ơi pajaau mak kơi piđó đóng lóóm karnóq ngôôk lơt, buôn têêng nôôq tarnêêng kah pâng dhalam, <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />taai ơi bâân buur tabil dyóp rau kah liêm, lơt aak, n'thaam, huông aak; bing bhlaai nôôq tarnêêng ưng rau makhinh palââng, leng đet, tarkaai tarlak, galơơk chachââr, kah ka-er; nôôq paraaq uôr xêi, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />baauq uôn, gaam geet Yaang Pleng, xaróh chachââr, praaq parlaach, pakah jơơr, bơk gluh paraaq lơt aak, kah xâng bóóp akonh akan, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />kah xưa tabech, kah markơi lóóm, kah kayô, kah ve lóóm nh'nhơr ka-er. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Achêk nek nôôq manưih dhơ ơi đơơp n'nal xêi xanêi bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, kơi ngaai têêng lơt nôôq tarnêêng kơi chêk nek đaang achêt, bơơi piđó eh mưi têêng lơt nôôq rau chêk, hơq piđó dyơq markơi lóóm đóng nôôq ngaai nak têêng lơt.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Đóng hayơq, nô manưih tôôh, dhơ dhangaai buôn đóók praaq xêi, amei kah ve taai hau rauriq chóóm ting paq, taai dhiq hau rau hơq amei praaq xêi lơt manưih lââng, nek amei tư yuur xêi lơt ađêi; taai amei nek manưih xêi lơt, kung têêng lơt nôôq tarnêêng achêk. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Dyơq nôôq he ơi n'nal kơi rau paraaq xanêi ưng Yaang Pleng nek glap palơq paraaq dhalam makhich lóóiq nôôq manưih têêng lơt nôôq tarnêêng kơi achêk. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Bơơi, nô manưih tôôh, nek manưih xêi lơt nôôq ngaai têêng lơt nôôq tarnêêng kơi chêk hơq chênh ađêi kung têêng nôôq tarnêêng kơi chêk, ve alua amei kanóq leq rau ađô, kơi amei e klươch lơh rau paraaq xanêi ưng Yaang Pleng? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Môôiq nek amei kađiq lơơi rau karvaan kabhôôq ưng lóóm m'pheep, lơq lóóm jruôn parngau, palơq rau đơơp parngau ưng Ađó, taai kah n'nal kơi lóóm m'pheep ưng Yaang Pleng đââng chơơng amei tơk rau klôôq lóóm? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Bơơi ganương ting rau nhâng-nhóóq ưng amei lơq tââq lóóm kah đơơp dhơ klôôq, amei xók tư karong ha-ơu rau pagrâ janah đóng ađêi kalóóng tangêi pagrâ janah lơq đóng pakah leq rau xêi xanêi dhalam m'pơng ưng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />nek Yaang e chróót đóng ting chanak manưih ting kơi nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng manưih achêk: <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Mưi hót nek rau mamông tơk nh'chró pakoom đóng nôôq ngaai achêk lalei cha-iil tabah lơq bhi chap palơq janaaq kiiq dyơq taluôn ting rau mưng lóóm ưng tarnêêng liêm, <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Hayơq hót tôôh nek rau pagrâ janah palơq ganhuh pagrâ papươnh pakoom đóng nôôq manưih taai n'thaam kiêng mưi ađêi lơq kah xâng paraaq dhalam hơq bâân malóóch môôiq ting rau kah liêm. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Bhrê hư lơq jarnah xarngaat tơơt dhiq dyóp ravaai ưng manưih têêng rau môôp, ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq laloom tââm, palơq ưng manưih Hi-laap. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Bơơi cha-iil tabah lơq bhi chap palơq yươq rauha pakoom đóng dyóp manưih têêng rau liêm, đóng manưih Jo Thaaiq laloom tââm, palơq đóng manưih Hi-laap. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Taai yươq ve rau paq katơq dhiq ve mat ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />La nôôq ngaai ơi têêng matu ting kơi kah ve gani, nek kung e chêt bil ting kơi kah ve gani, lơq hơq nôôq ngaai ơi têêng matu dhiq m'pơng gani, nek e bâân xêi xanêi palơq gani. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Taai eh rau nôôq manưih xâng gani nek bhơt liêm toom mat Yaang Pleng, bơơi nôôq manưih têêng ting gani nek e bâân đóók manưih liêm. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Taai xók nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, nek nôôq manưih dhanuôr kah ve gani, ting kơi kaxu têêng nôôq rau ưng gani, nek dhơ kah ve gani, piđó nek gani đóng chênh ađêi, <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />achêk nek nôôq manưih đóng lêi nôôq tarnêêng ưng gani bâân xaraq kalóóng lóóm piđó, xók kalóóng lóóm piđó truuih đuui, lơq nôôq karnóq lóóm takaauq môôiq patơk mơ praaq paq m'pơng chênh palơq xóng piđó <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />kalóóng tangêi hơq Yaang Pleng e xêi xanêi nôôq rau kadrêi lââp ưng akóón manưih tapâng dhiq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, ting kơi Taruuih Liêm ưng aku.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Dyơq la amei đââng dhanóók nek manưih Jo Thaaiq, ganơơm leq gani, pakah pajơơr kalóóng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />bâân n'nal karnóq kiêng Ađó, n'nal pâng lơt nôôq rau n'tua lơh bâân pató pachóóm tââq kalóóng gani, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />dhơ kơi ađek, amei tư đóng ađêi nek manưih đââng kalơng manưih kabaang, kalaaq brương đóng nôôq ngaai tơơt kalóóng bóng kanam, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />manưih praaq móón kabhuh ngôôk khơl, thêi pachóóm kabhuh manưih kah n'nal, taai ve pakala dyaang chadhaq ưng tarbech galang lơq ưng paraaq dhalam kalóóng gani, <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />kơi achêk nek, nô manưih pató pachóóm manưih lââng tôôh, amei kah pachóóm chênh ađêi kala alua? Nô manưih truuih pachóóm óóq tatông tôôh, amei ve tatông kah. <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Nô manưih móón kah chóóm têêng tapiing tôôh, amei ve têêng tapiing kah? Nô manưih harek haper nôôq yaang kabhêi tôôh, amei ve tông ađô nôôq ping klo kah? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Amei laach ađêi nek manưih tơơt kalóóng gani, amei ve praaq kađiq Yaang Pleng palơq tarnêêng têêng lơt gani kah? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ơi tââq “dhanóók Yaang Pleng bâân praaq tamôôp dhiq m'pơng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng taai nôôq pe” nham kơi paraaq ơi bâân xaraq. <verse eid="ROM 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Alua, dhơ pheep iêt ng'kar đââng tơk malơơi liêm la amei ve chóóm ting đuui gani, bơơi la amei nek manưih têêng lơt gani, nek tarnêêng iêt ng'kar ưng amei ơi val xar kah iêt ng'kar. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Kơi chêk nek, la mưi chanak kah ơi iêt ng'kar xâng jư nôôq paraaq kayua ưng gani, nek eh rau tarnêêng kah iêt ng'kar ưng manưih ađek e bâân lêi kơi tarnêêng ơi iêt ng'kar alua? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Lơq xók têêng paxong gani manưih kah ơi iêt ng'kar dhiq achak araang xók đôk e xêi lơt amei, nek manưih tââq bha-aar xaraq lơq pheep iêt ng'kar nek manưih têêng lơt gani. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ơi eh rau mưi manưih tââq dyaang achak hót nguôi nek manưih Jo Thaaiq, kung eh rau đu tơơt hót nguôi dhiq achak araang nek pheep iêt ng'kar, <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />klóóih dhiq ađek, manưih Jo Thaaiq nek kanóq lóóm tơơt dhiq lââp kadrêi hót kalóóng, lơq pheep iêt ng'kar nek ưng tala lóóm tââq Yaang Liêm, eh rau palơq bha-aar xaraq; hơq rau đaang haanh ưng manưih ađek eh rau tââq akóón manưih bơơi nek tââq Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Kơi achêk nek, karơ lơh ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq nek harau? Môôiq malơơi malaai ưng tarnêêng iêt ng'kar nek hau? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Lóng bơk leq dyóp rauriq! Taai laloom tabhơt, ađek nek piđó ơi bâân pajaau đóng nôôq taruuih paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Hau ngi têêng la maphơn manưih kah ve lóóm huuiq? Ve kơq lóóm kah huuiq ưng piđó e têêng đóng rau yươq tadhơ ưng Yaang Pleng xar kơi kah tating. <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Chiên ađek kah mơ chóóm vaaih. Palâh lóóiq, phaai bhi Yaang Pleng nek pâng dhalam, hayơq dyóp manưih nek manưih galơơk chachââr. Kơi ơi bâân xaraq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“Đóng dhơ dhakơi nek Ađó đóng dhơ dhakơi ơi bâân gluh pakah nek bhơt liêm kalóóng nôôq paraaq praaq ưng Ađó,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">lơq Ađó e đươk lơh xók Ađó đơơp xêi xanêi.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Bơơi la rau môôp ưng nôôq he pakah rau bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, nek nôôq he e praaq harau? Ve kơq Yaang Pleng kah dhalam xók n'toh ganhuh janah ưng Ađó? (Aku xók praaq ting kơi akóón manưih.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Chiên ađek kah mơ chóóm vaaih! Ơi la kơi achêk nek ng'kơi têêng Yaang Pleng e xêi xanêi manưih talaang katiêk? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Dyơq la rau paraaq dhalam ưng Yaang Pleng ơi têêng đóng cha-iil tabah Ađó yuur grơơt dhaang lơh dhiq rau chââr galơơk ưng aku, nek hau kơq aku bhiêk dyơq bâân taxêi xanêi kơi mưi manưih matu? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Lơq eh rau (nham kơi nôôq yi bâân baauq uôn lơq kơi ve nôôq ngaai móón dhakơi dhalam nôôq yi praaq kơi) “Nôôq he kơng têêng rau aak, buôn rau liêm ve chóóm vaaih tơk” kah lua? Tanóóm ưng piđó nek đaang dhalam.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Kơi achêk hayơq ng'kơi? Nôôq he ve liêm lơh kah? Maar dyóp kah. Hơq nôôq yi ơi kaauq patu miq manưih Jo Thaaiq palơq manưih Hi-laap, hayơq tabhơt phaai tơơt raal matu lơt. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Kơi ơi bâân xaraq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">“Kah ve ngaai bhơt liêm, patơk mơ mưi nak kung kah.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Kah ve ngaai n'nal rarau.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">Kah ve ngaai achêk lêi Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Tabhơt ơi vôôiq lơt hót. Piđó palơq xóng piđó val xar kah malơơi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">Kah ve ngaai têêng rau liêm, tơk mơ kah ve mưi ngaai.”<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />“Marlóng piđó nek bóng garha tarlóng.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Palơq n'taak ađêi, piđó bhiêk yuur gluh paraaq galơơk chachââr.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Chapââr ưng kaxênh dhuur tơơt dhiq bưưr piđó,”<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />“bóóp piđó kađôôq bing paraaq tóh đua lơq ahaaq atang.”<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />“Tapaang dyung piđó tarhơnh têêng tantoh ahaam.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Rau têêng pahư lơq jarnah ka-ai dhiq nôôq kalơng vôôiq ưng piđó.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Lơq piđó kah n'nal kalơng khe liêm.”<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />“Kah ve rau bhi kakhin Yaang Pleng toom mat piđó.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Kơi lââng, nôôq he n'nal kơi la rau dhơơm hơq gani truuih pachóóm nek praaq palơq nôôq ngaai tơơt kalóóng gani, buôn đóng ting beq bóóp bâân bơq parngau, lơq tabhơt manưih hóng katiêk đơơp matu lơt dhiq rau xêi xanêi tââq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ơi taai, toom mat Ađó, kah ngaai ngâ akóón manưih ng'kar m'bech bâân đóók bhơt liêm tââq nôôq tarnêêng têêng ting kơi gani. Taai rau đơơp n'nal matu lơt nek dhiq gani.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Bơơi xók đôk, rau bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng ơi bâân pakah giit nguôi gani, xók bâân truuih đuui tââq gani lơq nôôq manưih đââng taruuih, <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />hơq rau bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, nek tââq lóóm huuiq dhiq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq nek pakoom đóng dyóp ngaai huuiq, ơi yươq ve rau ađó pantua. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Taai dyóp ngaai ơi têêng matu lơt lơq bâân tabhuch bil cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />hơq yươq kơng chróót ađó janaaq rauriq xók bâân đóók nek bhơt liêm tââq ơơn phươk liêm ưng Ađó tapâng dhiq rau paq pók kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Yaang hơq Yaang Pleng ơi kanóq loom kơi mưi bhanuôih pók matu lơt đươi tââq lóóm huuiq dhiq ahaam Yaang achêk, buôn nek têêng pan-nal leq rau bhơt liêm ưng Ađó, ơi taai rau palơh lơơi nôôq matu lơt biêh ơi ve n'loom hei <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />tââq lóóm đơơp jruôn ưng Yaang Pleng, malóóm tơk tarnêêng buôn pakah rau bhơt liêm ưng Ađó kalóóng klaang đơơi xók đôk, buôn đóng Ađó nek bhơt liêm, lơq đóók bhơt liêm đóng ngaai tââp vaaih tââq lóóm huuiq dhiq Chuôq Jê-su.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Kơi achêk nek, rau tarhơơnh liêm tơơt n'đó dhiq? Ađó ơi bâân m'peq lơơi. Tââq n'đó gani? Gani ưng tarnêêng têêng alua? Eh rau! Bơơi nek tââq gani ưng lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Taai nôôq he chamet lêi mưi nak bâân đóók bhơt liêm tââq lóóm huuiq, eh tââq nôôq tarnêêng têêng ting gani. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Môôiq Yaang Pleng chapiên nek ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq hơq giêl? Kah alua kung nek ưng dhanuôr manưih katiêk lââng alua? Ơơq, kung nek ưng dhanuôr manưih katiêk lââng, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />ơi lalua chapiên ve mưi Yaang Pleng, nek Yaang e đóók bhơt liêm manưih đơơp iêt ng'kar tââq lóóm huuiq, palơq manưih kah iêt ng'kar đươi lóóm huuiq achêk.<verse eid="ROM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Kơi chêk nek, nôôq he ve têêng đóng gani bil tiêng palơq lóóm huuiq achêk kah? Chiên ađek kah mơ chóóm vaaih. Palâh lóóiq, nôôq he têêng tamưng gani.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Kơi chêk, nôôq he e móón Ap-ra-haam, abhươp avuôq ưng nôôq he ting kơi bâân lêi achak araang, ơi tabâân n'nal harau? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ơi la Ap-ra-haam bâân đóók bhơt liêm tââq tarnêêng têêng, nek ađó ve kơi chóóm buôn pajơơr, bơơi eh rau nek toom Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Ơi Bha-aar Yaang Pleng praaq harau? “Ap-ra-haam huuiq ganơơm Yaang Pleng, lơq tarnêêng ađek bâân đóók nek bhơt liêm đóng ađó.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Kơi lââng, ting kơi palơq ngaai têêng tarnêêng, nek jêên chaner kah bâân đóók kơi ơơn, bơơi nek kơi manơơq. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Dyơq ting kơi palơq ngaai kah têêng tarnêêng, hơq huuiq dhiq Yaang têêng manưih kah huuiq chóóm bhơt liêm, nek lóóm huuiq ưng manưih ađek bâân đóók nek bhơt liêm. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Patơk mơ kơi Đa-viit kung móón leq ơơn phươk ưng manưih hơq Yaang Pleng đóók nek bhơt liêm eh tââq tarnêêng têêng.<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Phươk đóng ngaai dhơơm hơq nôôq tarnêêng lơt aak ađêi ơi bâân tarlơơi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">lơq nôôq matu lơt ađêi ơi bâân jađơr pađơp.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Phươk đóng ngaai hơq Chuôq dhakơi ơi yươq yaap tơk matu lơt ưng ađó.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Kơi chêk nek, phươk liêm ađô pakoom đóng ngaai đơơp iêt ng'kar, môôiq kung pakoom đóng ngaai kah iêt ng'kar? Hơq nôôq he xók móón: “Lóóm huuiq achêk bâân đóók nek bhơt liêm đóng Ap-ra-haam.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Kơi chêk, lóóm huuiq ađek ơi bâân lêi ng'kơi kiq? Lơq dhiq xók ơi iêt ng'kar môôiq dhiq xók kah ơi iêt ng'kar? Eh rau dhiq xók ơi iêt ng'kar, bơơi nek dhiq xók kah ơi iêt ng'kar. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ađó ơi đơơp kanal iêt ng'kar kơi pakanal ưng rau bhơt liêm tââq lóóm huuiq, hơq nek lóóm huuiq dhiq xók kah ơi iêt ng'kar, buôn đóng ađó nek abhươp avuôq ưng tabhơt nôôq ngaai ve lóóm huuiq dhơ kah ơi iêt ng'kar, đââng tơk rau bhơt liêm bâân đóók đóng nôôq manưih achêk; <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />kung lơơi đóng ađó nek abhươp avuôq ưng manưih đơơp iêt ng'kar ting kơi palơq nôôq ngaai eh mưi yuur gluh tââq pheep iêt ng'kar, hơq dyơq nek nôôq manưih ting đuui lóih dyung lóóm huuiq ưng Ap-ra-haam abhươp avuôq nôôq he, dhiq xók kah ơi iêt ng'kar.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Taai paraaq hươq pakoom đóng Ap-ra-haam môôiq pakoom đóng akóón chachau ưng ađó, hơq nek buôn đóng ađó nek manưih pei đơơp talaang katiêk, eh rau đươi gani bơơi nek đươi rau bhơt liêm ưng lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Ơi la nôôq ngaai ting đơơp gluh tââq gani, nek lóóm huuiq bâân bil kah parđươi, lơq paraaq hươq bâân m'peq lơơi. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Tââq gani đââng lóóiq ganhuh pagrâ janah, bơơi n'đó dhiq kah ve gani nek kung kah ve rau têêng lơt. <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Ơi taai rau ađek, hayơq nôôq manưih bâân đơơp nek gluh tââq lóóm huuiq, hơq đóng ting đuui kơi ưng ơơn phươk liêm, buôn paraaq hươq nek dhakơi đóng dyóp akóón chachau, eh đóng ngaai chapiên gluh tââq gani hơq giêl, bơơi nek đóng ngaai kung gluh tââq lóóm huuiq ưng Ap-ra-haam, hơq ađó nek abhươp avuôq ưng tabhơt nôôq he, <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Kơi ơi bâân xaraq kơi ađô: “Aku ơi tavaaih akóón têêng ama ưng bơk dhanuôr manưih,” dhiq toom mat Yaang hơq amei huuiq ganơơm, hơq nek Yaang Pleng, Yaang têêng đóng manưih chêt ve parmông lơq đóók nôôq tarnêêng kah ve xar kơi ve; <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />hơq amei nek manưih ơi huuiq ganơơm dhiq rau lóóm rââm jalơh piing bhơt rau đương rââm, buôn đóng amei bâân val xar ama ưng bơk dhanuôr manưih, ting kơi rau ơi bâân paraaq: “Dhong nooi ưng akóón e nek kơi ađek.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Lơq dhơ yươq mơ dhur tabhlêh kalóóng lóóm huuiq, ađó ơi đơơp lêi achak araang chênh ađêi kơi bâân chêt aq (taai bâân mơ mưi hariêng tuôi), palơq nek bhơt xeu xó dhiq bhanaq akóón ưng Sa-ra. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Bơơi malóóm tơk paraaq hươq ưng Yaang Pleng, ađó ơi yươq paangra lóóm blah karnóq leq rau kah huuiq, palâh lóóiq, ađó ơi bâân praan karơ lơh kalóóng lóóm huuiq, xók tapôông cha-iil tabah leq Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />lơq ơi tabhơt bâân praaq pakah kơi hau rau Ađó ơi hươq, nek Ađó kung ve karơ mataai buôn yuur têêng. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Nek hayơq “lóóm huuiq achêk bâân đóók nek bhơt liêm đóng ađó”. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Kơi lââng, paraaq ơi bâân xaraq kơi: “lóóm huuiq achêk bâân đóók nek bhơt liêm đóng ađó”, eh rau chapiên taai ađó, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />hơq dyơq ơi nôôq he, nek đóng nôôq manưih hơq lóóm huuiq achêk e bâân đóók nek bhơt liêm, hơq nek đóng nôôq ngaai huuiq dhiq Yaang ơi têêng Chuôq Jê-su, Chuôq nôôq he, mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt, <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />hơq Ađó ơi bâân pajaau ơi rau têêng lơt ưng nôôq he, lơq ơi bâân têêng đóng mamông lóóiq taai rau đóók bhơt liêm ưng nôôq he.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Kơi chêk nek, taai ơi bâân đóók bhơt liêm tââq lóóm huuiq, nôôq he ve chóóm pakala rau têêng paliêm palơq Yaang Pleng đươi Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />hơq dhiq Yaang achêk, nôôq he tââq lóóm huuiq kung ơi ve kalơng mót kalóóng ơơn phươk liêm ađô, nek dhiq hơq nôôq he dyương mưng dhiq piing, lơq nôôq he tarhơơnh liêm ganơơm dhiq rau lóóm rââm leq cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Bơơi eh mơ kơi achêk, hơq nôôq he dyơq tarhơơnh liêm kalóóng bơk bhrê hư, ơi n'nal kơi bhrê hư đââng tơk ve đuôh đơơp jruôn; <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />hayơq đuôh đơơp jruôn ađô nek đââng tơk lóóm karnóq bâân klôôq paliêm, hayơq lóóm karnóq bâân klôôq paliêm ađô nek đââng tơk rau rââm ganơơm. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Dyơq rau rââm ganơơm achêk yươq têêng tabil rââm, ơi taai lóóm nh'nhơr ưng Yaang Pleng ơi bâân hóói n'toh kalóóng lóóm nôôq he đươi Chuôq Yaang Liêm, Yaang ơi bâân đóng leq nôôq he. <verse eid="ROM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Kung kah bhơt, xók nôôq he dyơq nek nôôq manưih kah praan kataai, nek tơk dhalam ganah, Chuôq Kriit ơi chêt klóóih đóng nôôq manưih kah huuiq. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Alua kadhaap ve ngaai e đơơp chêt klóóih đóng manưih bhơt liêm. Dhơ ve chóóm ve manưih kung khin chêt klóóih đóng manưih liêm kre. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Bơơi Yaang Pleng pakah đóng lóóm nh'nhơr ưng chênh Ađó ting kơi palơq nôôq he, ađek nek xók nôôq he dyơq nek manưih matu lơt, nek Chuôq Kriit ơi chêt klóóih đóng nôôq he. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Kơi achêk, xók ađôk, xók ơi bâân đóók bhơt liêm tââq ahaam Ađó, nek nôôq he e dyơq bâân paq lơh tââq pagrâ janah bơk lơh dyơq đươi Ađó. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ơi la nôôq he, dhơ nek môôp lơt, ơi bâân paliêm palơq Yaang Pleng đươi rau chêt ưng Akóón Ađó, nek xók ve ơi bâân paliêm aq, nôôq he e dhaang bâân paq tââq parmông ưng Ađó bơk lơh dyơq. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Bơơi kah mơ ađek, hơq nôôq he dyơq pajơơr ađêi kalóóng Yaang Pleng tapâng dhiq Chuôq nôôq he nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq đươi Ađó, xók ađôk nôôq he ơi bâân đơơp rau paliêm lóóiq.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Ơi taai kơi ađek, kơi chapiên dhiq mưi chanak hơq matu lơt ơi mót kalóóng talaang katiêk, lơq dhiq matu lơt nek akan chêt, kơi chêk hayơq akan chêt kung trââi tơơr tơk tabhơt akóón manưih, ơi taai rau ađek hơq dyóp ngaai ơi têêng lơt. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Ơi đóng tơk klaang ưng gani, nek matu lơt biêh ve tabhral kalóóng talaang katiêk ơi, bơơi matu kah bâân xêi tơk xók kah ve gani. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Dhơ kơi ađek, akan chêt ơi jaq tơơt tââq klaang A-đaam đóng patơk klaang Môôi-se, patơk mơ dhiq nôôq manưih yươq têêng matu lơt, dhiq kiêng thê markơi palơq rau têêng lơt ưng A-đaam, hơq ađó nek dyaang a-ô ưng Yaang phaai bhral.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Dhơ kơi ađek, rau têêng lơt kah thê ơơn liêm ting đuui kơi achêk. Ơi la tââq rau têêng lơt ưng mưi chanak hơq bơk manưih ơi chêt, nek ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, lơq kaliim kliim tââq ơơn phươk liêm ưng mưi chanak, hơq nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, pakoom đóng bơk ngaai nek xưa raai dhaang bơk lơh dyơq! <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kaliim kliim achêk eh rau thê kơi tapâng dhiq mưi chanak têêng matu. Ơi dhơ rau xêi xanêi tââq mưi chanak hơq gluh, đââng tơk rau têêng janah, bơơi yuur vaaih tââq bơk rau têêng lơt, ơơn liêm malóóm tơk rau bhơt liêm. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ơi la tââq rau têêng lơt ưng mưi chanak, hơq akan chêt ơi kadhâng akoq tapâng dhiq mưi chanak ađek, nek nôôq manưih bâân đơơp rau xưa raai ưng ơơn phươk liêm lơq ưng kaliim kliim leq rau bhơt liêm e dhaang kadhâng akoq bơk lơh dyơq kalóóng parmông đươi mưi chanak, hơq nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Kơi achêk hayơq, n'đó kơi tââq mưi rau tarnêêng lơt kađââng dyóp ngaai mót rau tarnêêng janah, nek tââq mưi tarnêêng têêng bhơt liêm kung kađââng dyóp ngaai tơk rau đóók bhơt liêm ưng parmông kơi achêk. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Ơi patơk mơ n'đó kơi tââq rau kah đơơp xâng ưng mưi chanak, hơq bơk ngaai bâân xar matu lơt, nek kung tââq rau xâng bóóp ưng mưi chanak hơq bơk ngaai e bâân vaaih bhơt liêm kơi achêk. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Kơi lââng, gani ơi mót kachóóq buôn rau têêng lơt ve chóóm vaaih bơk. Bơơi n'đó dhiq matu lơt vaaih bơk, nek ơơn phươk liêm dhaang xưa raai lơh, <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />hơq đóng matu lơt kadhâng akoq kalóóng akan chêt n'đó kơi, nek ơơn phươk liêm kung ve chóóm kadhâng akoq tââq rau bhơt liêm nek kơi chêk buôn kađââng tơk parmông nh'chró, đươi Chuôq Paq Manưih Jê-su, Chuôq nôôq he.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Kơi achêk nek, nôôq he e praaq ng'kơi? Nôôq he ve chóóm bhiêk tơơt kalóóng matu lơt buôn ơơn phươk liêm dyơq xưa raai kah? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Chiên ađek kah chóóm yuur vaaih. Nôôq he nek manưih ơi chêt ting kơi palơq matu lơt nek ng'kơi têêng nôôq he e bhiêk mamông kalóóng ađó? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Môôiq adhi anó kah n'nal kơi hơq ngaai ơi đơơp bap-teem kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih nek ơi bâân bap-teem mót kalóóng akan chêt ưng Ađó kah lua? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Taai ađek, nôôq he ơi bâân tơp palơq Ađó đươi pheep bap-teem mót kalóóng akan chêt, hơq đóng nham kơi Chuôq Kriit đươi cha-iil tabah ưng Ama ơi bâân têêng mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt n'đó kơi, nek nôôq he kung ve chóóm jađaang vôôiq kalóóng parmông tame kơi achêk. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ơi la nôôq he ơi val xar markơi palơq kung mađó rau chêt ưng Ađó, nek mat lââng, nôôq he kung e nek kơi achêk dhiq rau parmông lóóiq ưng Ađó; <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />taai n'nal rau ađô, kơi akóón manưih ti ưng nôôq he ơi bâân teeng đinh palơq Ađó, buôn achak araang ưng matu lơt ve chóóm bâân m'peq lơơi, yươq dyơq kađââng nôôq he têêng xól đóng matu lơt dyơq. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Ơi la ngaai ơi chêt nek bâân tabil lơơi nôôq tóóm patu tââq matu lơt. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Bơơi la nôôq he ơi chêt palơq Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek nôôq he huuiq kơi ađêi kung e mamông palơq Ađó, <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />taai n'nal kơi xong xók bâân têêng mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt, Chuôq Paq Manưih yươq ve chêt dyơq; akan chêt yươq dyơq kadhâng akoq dhiq Ađó. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ơi akan chêt hơq Ađó ơi đơơp, ađek nek Ađó ơi chêt ting kơi palơq matu lơt mưi chu dyóp aq. Dyơq parmông hơq Ađó mamông ađek nek Ađó mamông đóng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Kung ting kơi ađek, dhơ adhi anó phaai lêi chênh ađêi nek manưih chêt ting kơi palơq matu lơt, bơơi nek mamông đóng Yaang Pleng kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Kơi achêk, óóq lơơi matu lơt kadhâng akoq kalóóng achak araang ting huuiq dhiq akan chêt ưng adhi anó, buôn hayơq ting xâng nôôq malóóch kiêng ưng ađó. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Kung óóq pajaau nôôq achak araang ưng ađêi đóng matu lơt kơi đô-đaak ưng rau kah liêm. Bơơi phaai tapôông chênh ađêi đóng leq Yaang Pleng, kơi rau dyơq veq mamông tââq manưih chêt, lơq nôôq achak araang ưng ađêi kơi đô-đaak ưng rau bhơt liêm đóng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ơi taai matu lơt e yươq bâân kadhâng akoq dhiq adhi anó, ơi adhi anó yươq tơơt kalóóng gani, bơơi nek tơơt dhiq ơơn phươk liêm.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Kơi achêk nek ng'kơi? Nôôq he ve chóóm têêng matu taai nôôq he kah tơơt raal gani, hơq tơơt raal ơơn phươk liêm? Chiên ađek kah mơ chóóm vaaih. <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Adhi anó kah n'nal kơi adhi anó pajaau chênh ađêi đóng rauriq kơi têêng xól kalóóng rau huuiq bóóp, nek adhi anó val xar têêng xól đóng rau hơq ađêi huuiq bóóp kah lua, dhơ dhakơi nek ưng matu lơt đââng tơk akan chêt, môôiq nek ưng rau huuiq bóóp đââng tơk rau bhơt liêm? <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Bơơi ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng taai adhi anó biêh nek têêng xól ưng matu lơt, hơq adhi anó ơi tââq kalóóng lóóm huuiq xâng ting kơi palơq dhalam liêm paraaq pachóóm hơq ađêi bâân truuih đóng. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Hayơq xong xók bâân đââng pagluh lơh tââq matu lơt, adhi anó ơi bâân têêng xól đóng rau bhơt liêm. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Aku praaq ting kơi akóón manưih ơi taai tarlum dhur lóóm ưng manưih ti adhi anó. Ơi n'đó kơi adhi anó ơi pajaau nôôq achak araang ưng ađêi kơi têêng xól đóng rau anhuq lơq đóng rau kah matich ađô tơk rau kah matich tôôh, nek bhêêl đôk, kung kơi chêk, adhi anó phaai tapôông nôôq achak araang ưng ađêi kơi têêng xól đóng rau bhơt liêm malóóm tơk rau liêm tabah. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ơi xók adhi anó dyơq nek têêng xól ưng matu lơt, nek adhi anó biêh bâân rathaai ting kơi palơq rau bhơt liêm. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Kơi chêk adhi anó ơi ve harau yưưm xók achêk leq nôôq rau hơq xók ađôk adhi anó tư lêi kachiit mat? Taai xariêq ưng nôôq rau ađek nek akan chêt. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Bơơi xók ađôk, xong xók bâân paloh pagluh tââq matu lơt lơq bâân têêng xól đóng Yaang Pleng, adhi anó ve bóóng pale ưng ađêi đââng tơk rau tabah liêm, hơq xariêq nek parmông tơk nh'chró. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Taai jêên makông ưng matu lơt nek akan chêt, bơơi ơơn phươk ưng Yaang Pleng nek parmông tơk nh'chró kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Adhi anó ơơi (taai aku dyơq praaq palơq nôôq manưih n'nal gani), môôiq nek adhi anó kah n'nal kơi gani ve mataai karơ dhiq mưi nak dhiq nek mơ đươnh manưih ađek dyơq mamông kah lua? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Taai manưih pađiil ve kayiik ơi bâân gani dyuôch tamưng palơq manưih kayiik ưng ađêi dyơq mamông; bơơi la kayiik chêt, nek ađó bâân talơơi lơh tââq gani leq manưih kayiik achêk. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Kơi achêk hayơq, hơq xók kayiik dyơq mamông, la ađó bêch tơơt palơq mưi chanak padruuih lââng, nek ađó e đóng pakah mađó palơq dhanóók đóók manưih têêng tapiing. Bơơi la kayiik chêt, nek ađó bâân rathaai lơh tââq gani, ađó eh rau nek manưih têêng tapiing dhơ bêch tơơt palơq manưih kayiik lââng. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Kung kơi achêk, adhi anó ưng aku ơơi, chênh adhi anó kung ơi bâân têêng đóng chêt ting kơi palơq gani đươi achak araang ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, buôn đóng adhi anó bâân pajum nek palơq manưih lââng, hơq nek palơq Yaang ơi bâân têêng mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt, buôn đóng nôôq he ve chóóm bóóng pale đóng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Taai bhêêl nôôq he dyơq tơơt kalóóng manưih ti, nôôq n'thaam kiêng matu lơt tapâng dhiq gani biêh vôôiq veq kalóóng nôôq achak araang ưng nôôq he, buôn bóóng pale đóng akan chêt. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Bơơi ađôk nôôq he ơi bâân bhlêh m'peq tââq gani, taai ơi chêt ting kơi palơq rau hơq nôôq he biêh bâân kađaai tamưng, kơi achêk hayơq nôôq he ve chóóm têêng yaauq ting kơi liêm tame ưng Yaang Liêm hơq eh rau kơi ti hanua ưng bha-aar xaraq.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Kơi achêk, nôôq he e praaq harau? Gani nek matu lơt alua? Chiên ađek kah mơ chóóm vaaih. Dhơ kơi ađek, aku ơi kah đơơp n'nal matu lơt la kah đươi leq gani. Taai aku ơi kah đơơp n'nal matu n'thaam la gani kah móón: “Amei óóq n'thaam.” <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Bơơi matu lơt, xong xók ting pei kapươk dhiq gani pachóóm, ơi đââng lóóiq dyóp n'thaam malóóch kalóóng aku. Taai kah ve gani nek matu lơt chêt. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Kơi lââng, n'loom ahei, aku biêh mamông kah ve gani, bơơi xong xók gani pachóóm bhral, nek matu lơt ơi yuur mamông, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />dyơq aku nek chêt. Lơq gani pachóóm nek rau kađââng tơk parmông, nek ađó ơi bâân lêi kơi nek akan chêt ting kơi palơq aku. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Taai xong xók pei kapươk đươi dhiq gani pachóóm, matu lơt ơi galơơk chachââr aku, lơq tapâng dhiq ađek, ơi leng chêt aku. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Kơi achêk, gani nek liêm, gani pachóóm kung nek liêm, bhơt liêm, lơq liêm kre.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Kơi achêk, rau liêm ơi val xar akan chêt đóng aku môôiq alua? Chiên ađek kah mơ chóóm vaaih. Palâh lóóiq, buôn ting tapâng rau liêm kre, matu lơt ve nh'jau bâân tapakah nek matu lơt, hơq nek rau đââng lóóiq akan chêt kalóóng aku, hơq đóng dhiq gani pachóóm, matu lơt dhaang val kơi môôp aak bơk lơh. <verse eid="ROM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Taai nôôq he n'nal kơi gani nek liêm kre, hayơq chênh achak aku nek manưih ti ơi bâân baan têêng xól dhiq matu lơt. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Taai aku kah n'nal tarnêêng ađêi yuur têêng. Taai eh rau aku yuur têêng rau hơq aku kiêng. Bơơi aku yuur têêng rau hơq aku dyââng lêi. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Bơơi la aku têêng rau hơq ađêi kah kiêng, nek aku markơi karnóq palơq gani kơi gani nek liêm kre. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Bơơi bhêêl ađôk chênh aku kah dyơq têêng tarnêêng ađek dyơq, hơq nek matu lơt xók dyơq tơơt kalóóng aku. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Taai aku n'nal kơi rau liêm kah đơơp tơơt kalóóng aku, hơq nek kalóóng manưih ti aku. Taai rââm kiêng rau liêm nek bhiêk tơơt kađơu kalóóng aku, bơơi yuur têêng rau liêm nek kah. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Taai rau liêm hơq aku kiêng nek aku kah têêng, bơơi rau môôp hơq aku kah kiêng, nek aku yuur têêng ađó. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Dyơq la aku têêng rau hơq ađêi kah kiêng, nek eh rau chênh aku têêng rau achêk dyơq, bơơi nek matu lơt tơơt kađơu kalóóng aku. <verse eid="ROM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Kơi achêk hayơq, aku bâân n'nal gani ađô kalóóng aku, hơq nek kalóóng akóón manưih rââm kiêng têêng rau liêm ađô, ađek nek rau aak bhiêk dyơq tơơt at kalóóng aku. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Taai aku bhuui kiêng leq gani ưng Yaang Pleng ting akóón manưih hót kalóóng. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Bơơi aku bâân lêi mưi gani lââng kalóóng nôôq achak araang ađêi, tarjơl jaklâk lóóiq gani ưng lóóm karnóq aku lơq pa-eep aku palơq gani ưng matu lơt, nek gani dyơq tơơt dhiq kalóóng nôôq achak araang ưng aku. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Aku nek mưi chanak jarnah xarngaat! Ngaai e paq jóói aku lơh tââq achak araang ưng akan chêt ađô? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng đươi Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he! Taai kơi achêk nek hayơq, dhơ palơq lóóm karnóq, chênh aku têêng yaauq gani ưng Yaang Pleng, bơơi palơq manưih ti nek pakoom đóng gani ưng matu lơt.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Kơi achêk hayơq, xók ađôk yươq ve patu janah rauriq đóng nôôq ngaai tơơt kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Taai gani Yaang Liêm ưng parmông kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi tabâân paloh aku lơh tââq gani ưng matu lơt lơq akan chêt. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Taai ting kơi palơq tarnêêng kah chóóm đuôh ưng gani, hơq nek kalóóng tarnêêng ađó biêh dhur n'dhương taai achak araang, nek Yaang Pleng, xong xók kayua chênh Akóón Ađó bhral kalóóng dyaang achak thê kơi achak araang matu lơt lơq ơi taai matu lơt, Ađó ơi patu matu lơt kalóóng achak araang, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />buôn nôôq tarnêêng bhơt liêm ưng gani bâân têêng paxong kalóóng nôôq he, nek nôôq manưih yươq jađaang vôôiq ting manưih ti bơơi ting Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Taai nôôq manưih mamông ting manưih ti nek chamet leq nôôq rau mađó leq manưih ti, hayơq nôôq manưih ting Yaang Liêm nek chamet leq nôôq rau mađó leq Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Ơi lóóm karnóq ưng manưih ti nek akan chêt, hayơq lóóm karnóq ưng Yaang Liêm nek parmông lơq yươq rauha; <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />achêk nek taai lóóm karnóq ưng manưih ti nek tarjơl makhich palơq Yaang Pleng, ơi ađó kah đơơp xâng dhiq gani ưng Yaang Pleng, taai ađó kah ve chóóm đuôh buôn têêng kơi achêk. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Hayơq ngaai nôôq mamông ting manưih ti nek kah ve đuôh têêng bhuui lóóm Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Dhơ kơi ađek, adhi anó yươq tơơt kalóóng manưih ti, hơq nek kalóóng Yaang Liêm, la Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng alua dhalam tơơt jaq kalóóng adhi anó. Dyơq la ngaai kah ve Yaang Liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek manưih ađek kah mađó leq Ađó. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Palâh lóóiq la Chuôq Paq Manưih tơơt kalóóng adhi anó, nek dhơ achak araang nek akan chêt ơi taai matu lơt, bơơi Yaang Liêm nek parmông ơi taai rau bhơt liêm. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Dyơq la Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang ơi payuur Chuôq Jê-su mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt dyơq tơơt jaq kalóóng adhi anó, nek Yaang ơi payuur Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt kung e đóng parmông leq achak araang huuiq ting dhiq akan chêt ưng adhi anó, tââq Yaang Liêm Ađó tơơt jaq kalóóng adhi anó.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Kơi achêk hayơq, adhi anó ơơi, nôôq he eh rau nek manưih manơơq manưih ti buôn mamông ting manưih ti. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Ơi la adhi anó mamông ting manưih ti, adhi anó e phaai chêt, dyơq la đươi Yaang Liêm, adhi anó têêng chêt nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng achak araang, nek adhi anó e mamông. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ơi la ngaai bâân chơơng đââng tââq Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, nôôq manưih ađek nek akóón ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Taai adhi anó ơi yươq pei đơơp yaang ưng rau tarlum têêng xól buôn val malóóm tơk rau kakhin kapơn, bơơi adhi anó ơi pei đơơp Yaang Liêm ưng dhiq dham akóón partơơt, đươi ađek nôôq he yuur đóók: “A-ba, Ama!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Chênh Yaang Liêm truuih đuui nek palơq yaang lóóm nôôq he kơi nôôq he nek akóón anaaq ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Hơq la nek akóón anaaq, hơq kung nek manưih bâân đơơp: mưi hót nek nôôq manưih bâân đơơp ưng Yaang Pleng, mat lââng nek nôôq manưih mađó bâân đơơp palơq Chuôq Paq Manưih la nôôq he alua dhalam đơơp jarnah palơq Ađó buôn nôôq he kung bâân cha-iil tabah palơq Ađó.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Taai aku kanóq kơi nôôq jarnah ka-ai dhiq ganah xók đôk kah chóóm đaang marchơng palơq cha-iil tabah kanóq bâân tapakah đóng nôôq he. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Tââq rau bhơt lóóm rââm đương ưng rau ơi tavaaih xók puih lóóm rââm đương rau gluh pakah ưng akóón anaaq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Taai dyóp rau ơi bâân têêng huuiq dhiq tarlum kah machak maraang, eh rau kanóq kaniêng, bơơi nek taai Yaang ơi têêng piđó phaai xâng bóóp, ganơơm leq rau đương rââm <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Kơi chênh rau ơi tavaaih kung e bâân đââng paloh gluh tââq achak têêng xól ưng rau chêt bil buôn mót leq rau rathaai kalóóng cha-iil tabah ưng akóón anaaq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Taai nôôq he n'nal kơi tabhơt rau ơi tavaaih maar chaxih kagôh lơq tatrươih vaveq kalóóng ka-ai karuôq patơk tangêi ađôk. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Dhơ kơi ađek, eh mưi kơi achêk, hơq nôôq he kung kơi achêk, dhơ ve bâân pale tââp bóóng ưng Yaang Liêm — chênh nôôq he kung chaxih kagôh kalóóng ađêi, dyơq xók puih lóóm đương rââm dham tanơơt akóón partơơt, hơq nek rau paq pók achak araang ưng nôôq he. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Taai nôôq he ơi bâân paq kalóóng đương rââm mưng bhlơng. Hơq đương rââm la bâân dhamơn lêi nek eh rau nek đương rââm. Taai ve ngaai đương rââm leq rau hơq ađêi bâân lêi? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Dyơq la nôôq he đương rââm leq rau ađêi kah ơi lêi, nek nôôq he xók puih lóóm rââm đương palơq rau đuôh jruôn.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Bơơi ting kơi tarvaai ađek, Yaang Liêm kung ting poor kalóóng rau dhur lóóm ưng nôôq he. Taai nôôq he kah n'nal rau hơq nôôq he chóóm phaai gavơh nhan kơi ađêi đaang phaai têêng, bơơi chênh Yaang Liêm bhơt lóóm gavơh nhan palơq nôôq dhariêng ta-uih taxung kah chóóm truuih đuui palơq paraaq <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Dyơq Yaang chamet lêi lóóm manưih nek n'nal lóóm karnóq ưng Yaang Liêm nek ng'kơi, taai Ađó gavơh nhan dhalam pâng karnóq kiêng Yaang Pleng đóng nôôq manưih huuiq. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Mat lââng, nôôq he n'nal kơi Yaang Pleng têêng tavaaih dyóp rau nek palơq xóng piđó buôn kađââng tơk rau liêm kre pakoom đóng nôôq manưih nh'nhơr Yaang Pleng, hơq nek đóng nôôq manưih ve bâân rau dhaloong ting karnóq lơơi ưng Ađó. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Taai nôôq manưih hơq Ađó ơi n'nal loom, nek Ađó kung ơi kanóq lơơi buôn thê kơi dyaang a-ô ưng Akóón Ađó, hơq đóng Akóón achêk val xar Akóón taha dhiq m'pơng bơk adhi anó. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Mat lââng, nôôq ngaai hơq Ađó ơi kanóq lơơi, nek nôôq manưih ađek Ađó kung ơi dhaloong. Lơq nôôq ngaai hơq Ađó ơi dhaloong nek nôôq manưih ađek Ađó kung ơi đóók bhơt liêm. Dyơq nôôq ngaai hơq Ađó ơi đóók bhơt liêm, nek nôôq manưih ađek Ađó kung ơi têêng đóng cha-iil tabah.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Kơi achêk nek, nôôq he e praaq ng'kơi leq nôôq rau ađô? La Yaang Pleng xal mat đóng nôôq he, nek ngaai jơl makhich nôôq he? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Ađó alua dhalam nek Yaang ơi yươq châq chênh Akóón ađêi, bơơi ơi pajaau Akóón achêk klóóih đóng tabhơt nôôq he, nek haurau hơq Ađó e kah đóng kliim dyóp rau nek palơq Akóón achêk đóng nôôq he? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ngaai e kaauq matu lơt makhich lóóiq nôôq manưih bâân chââih ưng Yaang Pleng? Yaang Pleng nek Yaang đóók bhơt liêm. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Ngaai nek manưih móón matu lơt? Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih nek Yaang ơi chêt, bơơi lơh achêk dyơq, xong xók bâân têêng mamông lóóiq, Yaang achêk patơk mơ tơơt hót têi atươm Yaang Pleng, lơq Ađó xók nhan klóóih đóng nôôq he. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Ngaai e têêng tablah nôôq he lơh tââq lóóm nh'nhơr ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih? Kah alua chêt đok, jarnah xarngaat, tarvei tarleng, ha-ul rahaal, lalôh lalut, tamenh chêt, môôiq kóóih bhươt? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Kơi paraaq bâân xaraq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Ơi taai Ađó, nôôq akóón đơơp patu chêt tóóng tangêi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">Nôôq akóón bâân lêi kơi trưưu đââng leq tarnêêng leng paxêêt.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Dhơ kơi ađek, kalóóng dyóp rau achêk, nôôq he đươk lơh bhuui yayar đươi Yaang nh'nhơr ađêi. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Taai aku bâân ting xâng kơi kah ve akan chêt, môôiq parmông, kah ve nôôq dhơn pleng, môôiq nôôq kadhâng akoq, môôiq nôôq tarnêêng xók ađôk, môôiq nôôq rau e bhral, kah ve kataai karơ, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />môôiq paryaal, môôiq pardhơuq, kung kah ve dhơ dharau têêng tavaaih rau n'đó lââng, e ve n'jau đuôh têêng tablah nôôq he gluh lơh tââq lóóm nh'nhơr ưng Yaang Pleng, nek rau tơơt kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Aku praaq lalua kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih. Aku kah praaq chachââr — luônh lóóm aku truuih đuui đóng aku kalóóng Chuôq Yaang Liêm — <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />kơi nek palơq aku, ve rau ranguôq lóóm gamak lơq vaaih ka-ai karuôq kah bil kalóóng lóóm aku. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Taai aku biêh rââm kơi chênh ađêi bâân tóh đua, têêng tablah tââq Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi taai adhi anó aku, nek nôôq manưih griêq đan ưng aku ting ng'kar m'bech; <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />chênh piđó nek dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên, hơq nôôq rau chô leq piđó nek dhanóók têêng akóón partơơt, cha-iil tabah, nôôq raket bóóp, tarnêêng pajaau đóng gani, rau bhuôih haanh, lơq nôôq paraaq hươq; <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />piđó gluh tââq nôôq abhươp avuôq, lơq Chuôq Paq Manưih gluh tââq piđó (hơq nek ting ng'kar m'bech) — Ađó nek Yaang papiing lơh tabhơt dyóp rau, hơq nek Yaang Pleng đaang bâân bhi haanh patơk nh'chró chró. Alua achêk kơi.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Bơơi kah ve chiên paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng ơi bil praan kataai. Ơi eh rau tabhơt nôôq ngaai gluh tââq I-sơ-ra-êên, hơq ađek nek manưih I-sơ-ra-êên. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Kung eh rau tabhơt akóón chachau nek dhong nooi ưng Ap-ra-haam. Bơơi nek, “tââq I-saak, dhong nooi ưng akóón e bâân đóók achak.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Kiêng móón nek, akóón anaaq ting ng'kar m'bech, nôôq manưih achêk eh rau nek nôôq akóón ưng Yaang Pleng. Palâh lóóiq, akóón anaaq ưng paraaq hươq nek bâân đóók kơi akóón chachau. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Taai ađô nek paraaq hươq: “Mót xók ganah ađôk, Aku e bhral, lơq e ve mưi akóón padruuih koom đóng leq Sa-ra.” <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Bơơi kah chapiên kơi achêk, hơq Rê-bê-ka kung kơi achêk xók ve đađââng tââq mưi chanak, nek I-saak, abhươp avuôq ưng nôôq he, <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />taai xók bhêêl akóón kah ơi n'niên, kung kah têêng rau liêm môôiq rau aak lââng, buôn đóng kanóq kaniêng ưng Yaang Pleng ting rau chââih palưa ưng Ađó ve chóóm jư tamưng, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />eh rau tââq tarnêêng têêng, bơơi nek tââq Yaang dhaloong, rau ơi bâân đóng ađó bâân n'nal, ađek nek: “Chanak taha e têêng dhơn đóng chanak tadhi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Dhalam kơi rau ơi bâân xaraq: “Aku nh'nhơr Ja-kôôp, bơơi Aku dyââng lêi Ê-saau.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Kơi achêk, nôôq he e praaq n'đó kơi? Ve kơq ve rau kah marmơ makơi dhiq Yaang Pleng? Chiên ađek kah mơ chóóm vaaih. <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Taai Ađó praaq palơq Môôi-se kơi ađô: “Aku e pakah lóóm moor dha-iiq palơq dhơ dhangaai hơq Aku kiêng pakah lóóm moor dha-iiq, lơq Aku e kayô ka-er dhơ dhangaai hơq Aku kiêng kayô ka-er.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Kơi achêk hayơq eh rau tââq ngaai lââng rââm kiêng, kung eh rau tââq ngaai lââng mut leq têêh mut leq chooh, bơơi nek ting kơi Yaang Pleng, Yaang pakah lóóm kayô ka-er. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Taai Bha-aar Paraaq Yaang Pleng praaq leq Pha-ra-ôôn kơi ađô: “Ơi chênh kanóq kaniêng ađô Aku ơi hayuur amei yuur, buôn dhiq amei Aku ve chóóm pakah đóng mataai raman ưng Aku, lơq buôn ng'kơi đóng dhanóók Aku ve chóóm bâân truuih đuui dhiq plok katiêk.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Kơi achêk hayơq, Ađó pakah lóóm moor dha-iiq nek palơq ngaai manưih Ađó kiêng, bơơi Ađó têêng nhâng lóóm ngaai lââng Ađó kiêng.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Kơi ađek nek adhi anó e móón aku: “Kơi achêk, hau Amei dyơq bhiêk trêh? Taai ngaai jaklâk lóóiq karnóq ưng Ađó đuôh?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Nô manưih tôôh, praaq padrêh hơq amei nek ngaai hơq tar-ââi lơq Yaang Pleng? Ve kơq ađô đaak bâân niêl hayơq e móón palơq manưih ơi niêl xar ađêi: “Hau amei chóóm niêl tavaaih aku kơi ađô” hơ? <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Môôiq nek manưih niêl katiêk kah ve kataai dhiq katiêk ngaq, buôn yuur tavaaih mưi ađô parvech tââq mađó mưi garboq katiêk, dhơ beq ađô pakoom đóng tarnêêng kiiq bhlơng, bơơi rau tôôh pakoom đóng tarnêêng kah kiêt? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Dyơq la Yaang Pleng, taai kiêng pakah lalua pagrâ janah ưng Ađó lơq têêng pakah karơ mataai ưng Ađó, ơi đơơp kađung kalóóng rau jruôn parngau lóng gamak nek palơq nôôq ađô parvech pakoom đóng ganhuh pagrâ janah, ơi bâân ravang lơơi đóng rau leng kaxiêt; <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />lơq buôn Ađó ve chóóm têêng pakah rau karvaan ve ưng cha-iil tabah Ađó dhiq nôôq ađô parvech pakoom đóng rau kayô ka-er hơq Ađó ơi ravang lơơi đóng rau cha-iil tabah, <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />lơq tabhơt nôôq he, nek nôôq manưih hơq Ađó ơi dhaloong, eh mơ tââq manưih Jo Thaaiq, hơq dyơq tââq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, nek ng'kơi? <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Kơi Ađó kung praaq kalóóng bha-aar Ô-sê kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Aku e đóók ađó eh rau dhanuôr Aku, nek ‘dhanuôr Aku’,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">lơq ađó kah bâân nh'nhơr nek ‘manưih nh'nhơr bhlơng’.<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Lơq tavaaih tarnêêng e ve dhiq dham hơq paraaq ơi bâân truuih leq piđó, kơi ađô: ‘Nôôq pe eh rau dhanuôr Aku,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">nek chênh dhiq ađek piđó e bâân đóók nek ‘nôôq akóón padruuih ưng Yaang Pleng taluôn mamông.’”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Bơơi Ê-saai yuur praaq leq dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">“Dhơ parbơk akóón anaaq ưng dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên ve chóóm nek kơi xuôr taxiiq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">bơơi chapiên mưi phơn dyơq tagaleq lóóiq e bâân paq.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Taai Chuôq e yuur têêng paraaq Ađó dhiq katiêk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:28">paxong lơq đâh bhlơng.”<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Lơq kơi Ê-saai ơi praaq loom:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">“La Chuôq ưng nôôq praan karơ ơi kah châng lóóiq đóng nôôq he mưi akóón chachau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">nek dhơ dhakơi nôôq he ơi bâân val xar kơi kanóón Sô-đôôm,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">lơq dhakơi nek ơi bâân têêng đóng thê kơi kanóón Gô-mô-rơ.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Kơi achêk, nôôq he e praaq n'đó kơi? Achêk nek nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, hơq nek nôôq manưih kah ting taviêng rau bhơt liêm, nek ơi tơk bâân rau bhơt liêm, bơơi rau bhơt liêm ađek tââq lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Dyơq dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên, xók ting taviêng gani ưng rau bhơt liêm, nek ơi kah bâân tơk leq gani achêk. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Ơi taai hau rau? Achêk nek taai kah tââq lóóm huuiq, bơơi kơi tââq tarnêêng têêng. Piđó ơi n'đóih dyung leq khuk dhơl ưng rau têêng chađơl padhêh, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />kơi ơi bâân xaraq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Phaai lêi nô, aku patơơt dhiq Si-ôôn mưi khuk dhơl ưng rau padhêh chađơl lơq bhangôh dhơl ưng tarnêêng têêng lơt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">ngaai nak huuiq dhiq dhơl achêk e yươq bâân kachiit mat.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Adhi anó ơơi, rââm mamââk kalóóng lóóm aku lơq paraaq gavơh nhan ưng aku palơq Yaang Pleng klóóih đóng piđó nek buôn piđó ve bâân paq jóói. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Tââq aku truuih đuui leq piđó kơi piđó ve lóóm jêi tarang ting kơi palơq Yaang Pleng, bơơi kah ting kơi tabech n'nal dhalam. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Taai kah đơơp n'nal rau bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, lơq tabhơt praan buôn têêng tavaaih rau bhơt liêm n'tua ưng ađêi, hayơq piđó ơi kah đơơp xâng dhiq rau bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Taai Chuôq Paq Manưih nek rau paxong kanóq kaniêng ưng gani buôn đââng tơk rau bhơt liêm đóng dyóp manưih ve lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="ROM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Tââq Môôi-se xaraq leq rau bhơt liêm gluh tââq gani, kơi: “Ngaai chanak ơi têêng ting nôôq rau ađô, nek manưih achêk đươi ađek e mamông.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Bơơi rau bhơt liêm tââq lóóm huuiq praaq nô kơi: “Óóq praaq kalóóng lóóm ađêi kơi: ‘Ngaai e dyók tơk leq Pleng?’ (kiêng móón nek, buôn đââng Chuôq Paq Manưih dhaluônh); <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />môôiq: ‘Ngaai e dhaluônh tơk bóng dhơuq?’” (kiêng móón nek, buôn đââng Chuôq Paq Manưih yuur tââq akan chêt.) <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Palâh lóóiq, rau achêk praaq ng'kơi dhơq? “Paraaq tơơt đan akóón, kalóóng bóóp akóón lơq kalóóng lóóm akóón.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 10:8">Ađek nek paraaq lóóm huuiq hơq nôôq yi truuih karơ. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ơi la adhi anó đơơp đóók Jê-su nek Chuôq palơq bưưr bóóp ađêi, lơq adhi anó huuiq kalóóng lóóm ađêi kơi Yaang Pleng ơi payuur Ađó mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt, nek adhi anó e bâân paq. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Ơi ngaai tââq lóóm huuiq ganơơm nek đââng tơk rau bhơt liêm, dyơq ngaai tââq bóóp đóók chanót nek đââng tơk rau paq jóói. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Taai Bha-aar Paraaq Yaang Pleng móón: “Dyóp ngaai huuiq dhiq Ađó e yươq bâân kachiit mat.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ơi yươq ve rau pantua dhiq m'pơng manưih Jo Thaaiq lơq manưih Hi-laap; ơi mađó mưi Yaang nek Chuôq ưng tabhơt, karvaan ơơn ting kơi palơq tabhơt nôôq ngaai dhaloong gavơh Ađó. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Taai “dyóp ngaai, hơq nek tabhơt mak ngaai ơi dhaloong gavơh dhanóók Chuôq, e bâân paq.” <verse eid="ROM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Kơi achêk nek, palơq ng'kơi kiq piđó ve chóóm dhaloong gavơh tơk Yaang hơq piđó kah ơi huuiq? Hayơq ng'kơi têêng piđó ve chóóm huuiq Yaang hơq piđó kah ơi xâng? Hơq ng'kơi têêng hơq piđó ve chóóm xâng xók kah ve manưih truuih đuui? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Bơơi ngaai dhơơm achêk truuih đuui ng'kơi kiq la piđó kah bâân kayua? Kơi paraaq ơi xaraq, kơi ađô: “Tapaang dyung ưng nôôq manưih truuih đuui Taruuih liêm, liêm kre n'nal mơ!”<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Dhơ kơi ađek, eh rau tabhơt ơi xâng ting Taruuih liêm. Taai Ê-saai móón: “Kakoh Chuôq, ngaai ơi huuiq paraaq truuih đuui ưng nôôq yi?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Kơi achêk hayơq, lóóm huuiq tơk tââq bâân xâng, hơq bâân xâng achêk tapâng dhiq paraaq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Bơơi, aku nhan tamóh: “Ve kơq nek piđó ơi kah bâân xâng?” Praaq padrêh kơq nek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“Dhariêng ưng nôôq manưih achêk ơi yuur tanđôôr tơk plok katiêk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">lơq paraaq ưng piđó tơk nôôq dhiq xariêq ưng talaang katiêk.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Dhơ kơi achêk, aku nhan tamóh: “Ve kơq nek manưih I-sơ-ra-êên ơi kah ve n'nal?” Laloom tââm, Môôi-se móón:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Chênh Aku e têêng đóng nôôq pe tatrô môôp lóóm tââq ngaai ađek eh rau nek mưi dhanuôr.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">Aku e ơơr đóng nôôq pe yuur pagrâ palơq mưi dhanuôr kah ve chóóm n'nal rarau.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Hayơq Ê-saai kung nhóól lóóm, lơq ađó praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">“Aku ơi bâân tarlum tââq nôôq ngaai kah chik chêk Aku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">Aku ơi hayơq pakah padrêh đóng nôôq ngaai kah gavơh tamóh Aku.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Dyơq palơq dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên, Ađó praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">“Bhluuch matangêi, Aku dhương têi ađêi malóóm leq mưi dhanuôr kah xâng bóóp lơq lalak huông.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Kơi achêk aku nhan tamóh: Ve kơq Yaang Pleng ơi kah đươi dhanuôr Ađó? Chiên ađek kah mơ chóóm yuur vaaih. Taai achak araang aku kung nek mưi manưih I-sơ-ra-êên, tââq dhong nooi Ap-ra-haam, mađó kabhuh Bêên-ja-miin. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Yaang Pleng ơi yươq kah đươi dhanuôr Ađó, nek dhanuôr Ađó ơi n'nal loom. Môôiq adhi anó kah n'nal Bha-aar Yaang Pleng praaq harau leq Ê-li, xók ađó truuih đuui palơq Yaang Pleng kađiq lóóiq dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />“Kakoh Chuôq, piđó ơi leng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih Amei, piđó ơi pahư lơơi para bhanuôih Amei, nek chapiên mưi akóón dyơq bâân tagaleq mamông, lơq piđó dyơq achêk tabâân parhââm mamông akóón.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Bơơi paraaq ââi tabah liêm praaq palơq ađó nek harau? “Aku ơi lơơi pakoom leq Aku tapól ngaan manưih padruuih, nek nôôq manưih ơi yươq chakoh takól toom Ba-en.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Kơi ađek kung ting kơi achêk kalóóng ganah bhêêl xók ađôk, ve dhiq dyơq mưi phơn tagaleq lóóiq ting rau tabâân chââih ưng ơơn phươk liêm. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Bơơi la tââq ơơn phươk liêm, nek eh rau tââq tarnêêng têêng dyơq. La kah, ơơn phươk liêm kah dyơq nek ơơn phươk liêm. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Kơi achêk nek ng'kơi? Rau hơq dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên chik-chêk, nek dhanuôr achêk ơi kah bâân tarlum ađó, hơq ngaai manưih bâân chââih nek bâân tarlum, bơơi maphơn dyơq lóóiq ơi bâân kađiq lóóm, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />kơi rau ơi bâân xaraq, kơi ađô: “Yaang Pleng ơi đóng leq piđó lóóm yaang ngôôk ngaak, mat kah lêi, katór kah xâng, đóng patơk tangêi ađôk.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Lơq Đa-viit nek móón:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Phaai lơơi m'beq baang ưng piđó val xar jươl, biêng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">kaliêng dhơl n'đóih dyung, lơq rau chróót bharang pakoom đóng piđó.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Phaai lơơi mat piđó bâân kanam abhơơm buôn óóq lêi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">Lơq nek têêng hóng piđó bhiêk vang ligong taluôn.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Kơi achêk, aku nhan tamóh: “Ve kơq piđó ơi n'đóih kalơm buôn hayơq m'bhuôh tatóp?” Chiên ađek kah mơ chóóm vaaih. Klóóih leq ađek, tââq rau têêng lơt ưng piđó, rau paq jóói tơk palơq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, buôn têêng đóng piđó tatrô môôp lóóm. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Mat lââng, la rau têêng lơt ưng piđó đââng tơk rau karvaan kabhôôq ưng hóng katiêk, lơq rau hat tabhuch ưng piđó đââng tơk rau karvaan kabhôôq ưng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, nek rau dyóp liêm ưng piđó e dhaang karvaan kabhôôq xưa raai lơh n'nal mơ? <verse eid="ROM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Dyơq ađôk, aku nhan móón palơq adhi anó nek nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng. Kơi achêk, dyơq ơi taai chênh ađêi aku nek sưưq-đô đóng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, aku pei têêng tarhơơnh leq tarnêêng têêng ưng ađêi, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />dhơ đóng palơq n'đó kơi ađek, aku ve chóóm têêng đóng dhanuôr ting phơn achak ưng aku môôp lóóm lơq ve chóóm bâân paq mưi phơn manưih tââq dhiq piđó. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Ơi la rau dhươih lơơi ưng piđó đââng tơk rau paliêm lóóiq ưng manưih hóng katiêk, nek tarnêêng piđó pei đơơp e nek ng'kơi la eh rau nek parmông gluh tââq akan chêt? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Mat lââng, la phơn amun laloom tarnââp nek liêm, nek tabhơt bhôôk amun ađek kung kơi achêk. Lơq la riêh nek liêm, nek nôôq đóóng kung kơi achêk. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Bơơi la mưi phơn đóóng ơi bâân veh lơơi, dyơq adhi anó, xók nek đóóng ô-liiu booiq, ơi bâân tabóq leq kalóóng dhiq piđó, lơq ơi val xar kơi manưih ting đơơp dyet mamông bhlaai bing tââq riêh ưng n'lóóng ô-liiu achêk, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />nek óóq laach ađêi lơh nôôq đóóng lââng. Bơơi dhơ adhi anó laach jơơr, nek hei kơi eh rau achak araang adhi anó đơơp tabóq riêh n'lóóng, hơq nek riêh n'lóóng đơơp tabóq adhi anó. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Kơi achêk nek, adhi anó e móón: “Nôôq đóóng achêk ơi bâân veh lơơi, buôn chênh aku ve chóóm bâân mót tabóq.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Pâng kơi achêk! Piđó ơi bâân veh lơơi taai rau kah huuiq, hayơq chênh adhi anó nek dyương tamưng đươi lóóm huuiq. Óóq charngô tơk nôôq lóóm kanóq têêng ađêi ađêi, hơq phaai kakhin kapơn. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ơi la Yaang Pleng ơi kah châq lơơi nôôq đóóng kơi vaaih kaxu tôôh, nek Ađó kung e kah lơơi châq adhi anó. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Kơi achêk, phaai lêi n'nal lóóm moor dha-iiq lơq rau pagat ưng Yaang Pleng: dhơ rau pagat nek palơq nôôq manưih ơi lơơi lóóm huuiq, bơơi lóóm moor dha-iiq ưng Yaang Pleng pakoom đóng adhi anó, la adhi anó bhiêk tơơt kalóóng lóóm moor dha-iiq Ađó. Hơq la kah, chênh adhi anó kung e bâân kut m'peq. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Dyơq nôôq manưih tôôh kung kơi achêk, la piđó yươq pajêi kalóóng rau kah huuiq, nek piđó e bâân mót tabóq. Tââq Yaang Pleng ve mataai karơ buôn tabóq piđó mót lóóiq. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Ơi la adhi anó ơi bâân chapech tââq mưi beq n'lóóng ting kơi vaaih kaxu nek n'lóóng ô-liiu booiq, lơq ơi bâân tabóq lơt palơq kơi vaaih kaxu leq tââm ô-liiu liêm, nek nôôq manưih achêk, hơq nek nôôq manưih đơơp ting kơi vaaih kaxu, e dhaang bâân tabóq leq n'lóóng ô-liiu ưng chênh ađêi bơk lơh n'nal mơ?<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Taai adhi anó ơơi, aku kah kiêng adhi anó kah n'nal leq rau takadrêi ađô, buôn adhi anó kah ve rau tabech galang ting achak araang ađêi. Taai rau karđiq lóóm gluh tââq mưi phơn dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên ơi yuur vaaih, đóng patơk xók dyóp phơn nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng ting mót; <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />lơq kơi achêk, tabhơt I-sơ-ra-êên e bâân paq, kơi ơi bâân xaraq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Yaang paq jóói e bhral tââq Si-ôôn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">Ađó e m'peq lơơi nôôq rau kah huuiq gluh lơh tââq Ja-kôôp.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Lơq ađek nek raket bóóp patư tââq Aku pakoom đóng piđó,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">xók Aku e m'peq lơơi matu lơt ưng piđó.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Dhơ ting Taruuih Liêm, piđó nek manưih brau makhich ơi taai malơơi ưng adhi anó. Bơơi ting rau tabâân chââih, hơq piđó nek manưih bâân nh'nhơr bhlơng ơi taai nôôq abhươp avuôq ưng piđó. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Taai nôôq ơơn liêm lơq rau dhaloong kayua ưng Yaang Pleng nek nôôq rau kah ve chóóm tadhơ. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Taai pamơ kơi chênh adhi anó n'loom ahei ơi kah xâng Yaang Pleng, hơq ađôk ơi bâân kayô ka-er dhiq rau kah xâng ưng nôôq manưih ađô, <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />nek kung kơi achêk, nôôq manưih ađô xók ađôk ơi kah xâng bóóp dhiq rau kayô ka-er adhi anó, buôn xók ađôk piđó kung ve chóóm bâân kayô ka-er. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Taai Yaang Pleng ơi król dyóp ngaai kalóóng rau kah xâng bóóp, buôn Ađó ve chóóm pakah lóóm kayô ka-er dyóp ngaai.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Ơ, kre alua pardhơuq leq rau kabhôôq karvaan ve lơq rau tabech galang palơq rau bâân n'nal ưng Yaang Pleng! N'đó kơi nôôq paraaq pagat ưng Ađó kah đuôh chóóm chamet lêi, lơq kalơng vôôiq Ađó kah bhơt chóóm n'nal!<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />“Ơi ngaai ơi n'nal lóóm karnóq ưng Chuôq?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Môôiq ngaai ơi val kơi manưih kađââng paraaq ưng Ađó?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Hamôôiq ngaai ơi đóng Ađó laloom,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">hayơq e bâân Ađó chróót lóóiq?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Taai dyóp rau gluh tââq Ađó, đươi tââq Ađó, lơq malóóm leq Ađó. Cha-iil tabah chô leq Ađó patơk nh'chró chró. A-meen.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Kơi achêk, adhi anó ơơi, tââq rau kayô ka-er ưng Yaang Pleng, aku mââl bhơơl adhi anó đââng tapôông đóng Yaang Pleng achak araang ađêi kơi mưi bhanuôih mamông, tabah liêm, iêm lóóm Ađó. Hơq nek rau bhuôih haanh pâng dhalam ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Lơq óóq ralap tađuui ting đơơi ađôk, bơơi phaai bâân paxar kơi rau raxal tame ưng lóóm karnóq, buôn adhi anó bâân lêi lalua hau rau nek karnóq kiêng liêm kre, iêm lóóm, lơq bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Ơi, đươi ơơn phươk liêm ơi bâân đóng leq aku, aku nhan móón palơq dyóp ngaai tơơt dhiq m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó óóq vaaih kanóq leq ađêi yaal lơh rau phaai kanóq. Klóóih dhiq ađek nek kanóq lêi buôn đâh n'nal pakala, ting kơi Yaang Pleng ơi blah nh'xóóng mơ dheng đơq lóóm huuiq đóng ting chanak. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Ơi patơk mơ kơi nôôq he ve bơk dyung têi moh mat kalóóng mưi achak, bơơi tabhơt nôôq dyung têi moh mat kah ve makơi mưi tarnêêng têêng, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />nek ting kơi tarvaai ađek, bơk ngaai nôôq he, nek mưi achak kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq ting dyóp chanak nek dyung têi moh mat ưng xóng ađêi. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Bơơi nôôq he ve nôôq kaliim kliim ơơn liêm n'tua kơi ting mơ ơơn phươk liêm ơi bâân đóng leq ađêi: la ve nek ơơn đââng taruuih Yaang Pleng, nek yuur praaq ting mơ ve lóóm huuiq; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Ve alua nek ơơn têêng yaauq, nek pei têêng kalóóng tarnêêng têêng yaauq; ve alua nek ơơn pató pachóóm, nek pei têêng kalóóng tarnêêng pató pachóóm; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />la ve nek ơơn tabhơơl lóóm, nek pei têêng kalóóng tarnêêng tabhơơl lóóm; ơơn đóng kliim, nek têêng pakah palơq đóng yươq xêi chróót; ơơn têêng takóh, nek têêng pakah palơq rau bhơt lóóm; ơơn pakah lóóm kayô ka-er, nek têêng pakah palơq rau bhuui marhaal.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Tanhơr nek yươq paliêm dhiq bóóp, taai harek haper rau môôp, jư ađêi tabóq tamưng palơq rau liêm; <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />nek rau tanhơr pakoom đóng xóng ađêi kalóóng lóóm tanhơr adhi anó; têêng xamil đóng xóng ađêi kalóóng rau bhi chap; <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />nek kah kadhơq kayơng paangra kalóóng rau jêi tarang; kiêng têêng kalóóng lóóm karnóq; yaauq têêng tarnêêng Chuôq; <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />bhuui marhaal kalóóng lóóm rââm; jruôn parngau kalóóng bhrê hư; markơi-kơi dhiq rau gavơh nhan. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Paak blah nôôq rau tabhuch tapiêl ưng nôôq manưih huuiq liêm; ting tađuui lóóm nh'nhơr tamóói. <verse eid="ROM 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Phaai nhan phươk đóng nôôq manưih têêng pahư adhi anó; phaai nhan phươk, lơq óóq tóh đua; <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />buôn bhuui nek palơq nôôq manưih bhuui; buôn nhiim nek palơq nôôq manưih nhiim; <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />xók ve mađó mưi kanóq pakoom đóng xóng ađêi, óóq ve kanóq parlaach pajơơr, bơơi nek jruôn đơơp đươi nôôq manưih kah dyóp kanóq. Óóq val kơi tabech galang ganơơm dhiq chênh ađêi; <verse eid="ROM 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />xók yươq chróót charóót rau aak palơq rau aak đóng dhơ mak ngaai, pajêi gamang nôôq rau liêm kre toom mat dyóp ngaai; <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />la ve đuôh, dhiq n'đó dham mađó leq ađêi, nek jư lêi rau paliêm palơq dyóp ngaai; <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />adhi anó bơk nh'nhơr ơơi, óóq tư ađêi chróót charóót, bơơi phaai châng dham đóng ganơt janah ưng Yaang Pleng, taai rau ơi bâân xaraq: “‘Tarnêêng chróót charóót pakoom đóng Aku; Aku e chróót charóót,’ Chuôq praaq kơi ađek.”<verse eid="ROM 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />“Dhơ kơi ađek, la manưih brau adhi anó ve ha-ul, phaai đóng ađó cha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">La ađó ađek rahaal, phaai đóng ađó ơm.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">Ơi xók têêng kơi ađek, adhi anó e kaboq rahââng óih róh dhiq akoq ađó.”<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Óóq lơơi ađêi bâân ting tađuui tââq rau aak, bơơi phaai đươk lơh rau aak palơq rau liêm.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Tabhơt ting chanak phaai xâng bóóp nôôq takóh kala kataai dhiq piing ađêi, taai kah karơ kataai n'đó chóóm dyơq la kah tââq Yaang Pleng, dyơq nôôq karơ kataai xók ađôk nek bâân đóng pheep tââq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Kơi achêk hayơq, ngaai patơơt ađêi jơl jaklâk karơ kataai ađek nek jaklâk jơl lóóiq paraaq kayua ưng Yaang Pleng, hơq nôôq manưih jơl jaklâk achêk nek tư pei đơơp rau xêi janah đóng ađêi. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Taai nôôq manưih kala kataai eh rau nek avaaih kakhin kapơn ting kơi palơq tarnêêng liêm, bơơi nek đóng tarnêêng aak. Dyơq adhi anó kiêng yươq phaai kakhin manưih kala kataai achêk? Phaai têêng rau liêm, nek adhi anó e đơơp rau bhi haanh tââq manưih manưih kala kataai, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />ơi taai manưih achêk nek dhơn ratơơq ưng Yaang Pleng malóóm tơk rau kre liêm đóng adhi anó. Bơơi la adhi anó têêng tarnêêng aak, nek phaai kakhin kapơn, taai ađó yươq kadhâng bhươt kơi kah machak maraang, taai ađó nek dhơn ratơơq ưng Yaang Pleng, hơq nek manưih chróót charóót buôn ganhuh pagrâ janah pakoom đóng manưih yuur têêng tarnêêng aak. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Taai ađek, rau kơng bhlơng nek đơơp xâng bóóp, eh mưi taai ganhuh pagrâ janah, hơq dyơq ơi taai lóóm kanóq. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Tââq kung taai rau ađek hayơq adhi anó goop paklóóih; taai piđó nek dhơn ratơơq ưng Yaang Pleng, tabhơt praan xalia ting kơi palơq chênh tarnêêng ađô. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Phaai chróót đóng dyóp ngaai rau ađêi manơơq piđó: paklóóih đóng manưih pagoop paklóóih, jêên đóng manưih pagoop jêên, kakhin manưih đaang phaai kakhin, bhi manưih đaang phaai bhi.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Óóq manơơq ngaai dhơ dharau, lơh tââq tanhơr palơq xóng ađêi, taai ngaai nh'nhơr manưih đan tóór ađêi nek têêng dyóp gani. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Taai rau ađô: “Akóón óóq têêng matu tapiing, akóón óóq leng manưih, akóón óóq tatông papei, akóón óóq n'thaam jahaam,” lơq la dyơq dhơ dharau paraaq kayua n'đó lââng, nek dyóp rau achêk bâân pantoom kalóóng paraaq ađô: “Akóón phaai nh'nhơr manưih đan tóór ưng akóón kơi chênh ađêi.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Lóóm tanhơr kah têêng mahaai manưih đan tóór ađêi. Kơi achêk, nh'nhơr nek rau têêng dyóp gani.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Lơq kơi achêk, taai n'nal bhêêl ganah, kơi ơi tơk bhêêl đóng adhi anó phaai yuur meh tââq bhanêch bêch. Taai xók ađôk rau paq jóói ưng nôôq he ơi đan machơng palơq bhêêl nôôq he tame huuiq. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Hayum n'dhương lơh, dyơq tangêi đan tơk. Kơi achêk, nôôq he phaai m'peq lơơi nôôq tarnêêng ưng rau kanam kajeem, hayơq pei bak pluung panenh ưng rau brương. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Nôôq he phaai jađaang vôôiq kơi đóng tagap, kơi dhiq m'pơng tangêi, kah ơm cha, lơq ból plơ; kah mamông tapiing taniêt lơq mak mơ, kah tarkaai tarlak lơq dyââng lêi. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Palâh lóóiq, phaai pei xơp Chuôq, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq óóq têêng vôôiq ting mangê kanóq loom ưng manưih ti malóóm leq nôôq malóóch kiêng.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Mat lââng, phaai pơh jóói manưih dhur kalóóng lóóm huuiq, kah malóóm tơk tarnêêng xêi praaq nôôq tarkaai tarlak. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Dhơ mưi ngaai ađek ve lóóm huuiq buôn cha dyóp rau, bơơi manưih dhur lóóm nek chapiên cha bhơơi pale. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Manưih cha óóq kađiq lêi manưih kah cha, dyơq manưih kah cha óóq xêi lơt manưih cha. Taai Yaang Pleng ơi pơh đơơp ađó. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Manưih xêi lơt dhơn ratơơq kalóóng đong ưng palââng, amei nek ngaai? Manưih achêk dyương môôiq kalơm nek ting kơi palơq kala ưng chênh ađó kala. Bơơi manưih achêk e bâân têêng đóng dyương mưng, Taai Chuôq ve karơ mataai têêng ađó ađek dyương mưng. <verse eid="ROM 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Dhơ manưih ađô blah đóng tangêi tôôh palơq tangêi achêk, Bơơi palââng nek kanóq dyóp tangêi nek kre liêm. Ting chanak phaai huuiq tamưng kalóóng karnóq ađêi. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Manưih jư tangêi nek jư taai Chuôq, manưih cha nek cha taai Chuôq, taai manưih ađek ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng. Manưih kah cha, nek kah cha taai Chuôq, manưih achêk kung ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Taai kah ngaai kalóóng nôôq he mamông taai chênh ađêi, lơq kah ngaai chêt taai chênh ađêi. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Tââq lơq xók nôôq he mamông, nek mamông taai Chuôq, palơq xók nôôq he chêt, nek chêt taai Chuôq. Kơi achêk, lơq xók nôôq he mamông palơq xók nôôq he chêt, nek nôôq he maar mađó leq Chuôq. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Ơi buôn kađââng tơk rau ađô, Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi chêt lơq ơi val mamông, buôn Ađó têêng Chuôq tabhơt Chuôq lơq ưng manưih chêt lơq ưng manưih mamông. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Bơơi anó ađô, hau amei xêi lơt adhi anó ađêi? Hamôôiq anó tôôh, hau amei kađiq lêi adhi anó ađêi? Taai tabhơt nôôq he e dyương pakah ađêi toom tanơơt praaq xêi ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Tââq paraaq ơi bâân xaraq:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 14:11">“Chuôq praaq kơi ađô: ‘Kơi Aku taluôn mamông, dyóp tarkól e chakoh toom Aku,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 14:11">lơq dyóp n'taak e đơơp truuih toom Yaang Pleng.’”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Kơi achêk hayơq, ting chanak kalóóng nôôq he e đââng pagluh paraaq truuih pakah leq chênh ađêi palơq Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Taai ađek, nôôq he óóq chêk xêi lơt xóng ađêi dyơq, palâh lóóiq, nek phaai kanóq nô kơi nh'jang, kah patơơt khuk dhơl pagan kađơl kalơng hamôôiq taai ađek n'đóih kalơm đóng adhi anó ađêi. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Aku n'nal lơq bâân praaq pakah kalóóng Chuôq Jê-su, kơi kah ve dhơ dharau tââq achak araang ađó nek anhuq, chapiên ngaai manưih chamet lêi hau rau ađek nek anhuq, ađó nek anhuq ting kơi palơq manưih achêk. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ơi la ngaai adhi anó ađêi pâng têêng đóng môôp lóóm ơi taai chana dhanah, nek adhi anó kah dyơq jađaang vôôiq ting lóóm tanhơr dyơq. Óóq taai chana dhanah ưng ađêi têêng pahư manưih adhi anó achêk, hơq nek manưih hơq Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi chêt klóóih. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Kơi achêk, óóq lơơi rau kre liêm ưng adhi anó bâân praaq tamôôp. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Taai katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng eh rau tââq chana dhanah lơq đơơk ơm, bơơi nek rau bhơt liêm lơq yươq rauha, palơq rau bhuui marhaal kalóóng Chuôq Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Taai ngaai têêng tarnêêng Chuôq Paq Manưih ting kơi ađô nek liêm lóóm Yaang Pleng lơq bâân iêm lóóm tââq akóón manưih. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Kơi achêk hayơq, nôôq he phaai ting taviêng nôôq rau paliêm pakre lơq nôôq rau tơq hayuur koom đóng xóng ađêi. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Óóq têêng pahư nôôq tarnêêng ưng Yaang Pleng taai nôôq rau chana dhanah. Dhơ dyóp rau nek sek liêm, bơơi nek matu lơt ting kơi palơq manưih cha ting kơi tavaaih têêng paxruuk palơt. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Rau liêm kre nek kah đah adhah kung kah ơm buôh hamôôiq tabhơt dhơ dharau hơq dhiq ađek têêng manưih adhi anó ưng ađêi n'đóih kalơm, hamôôiq bâân mơk lơt, môôiq nek val vaaih dhur lóóm. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Chênh achak adhi anó ve lóóm huuiq n'đó kơi, nek pei jư ting dhiq chênh ađêi toom mat Yaang Pleng. Phươk đóng nek manưih yươq tư xêi lơt ađêi kalóóng rau ađêi lêi nek dhalam. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Bơơi mưi chanak ơi bâân patu la manưih achêk ơi cha dyơq xók paangra, taai kah yuur vaaih tââq lóóm huuiq. Mat lââng, dyóp rau tarnêêng hơq kah yuur vaaih tââq lóóm huuiq hơq nek matu.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Bơơi nôôq he, nek manưih karơ phaai ting kajóói nôôq dhur óóch ưng manưih kah karơ, lơq kah têêng iêm lóóm ađêi. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Ting chanak kalóóng nôôq he phaai têêng iêm lóóm manưih đan tóór ađêi taai kanóq kaniêng liêm kre, malóóm tơk tarnêêng tơq hayuur manưih achêk. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Taai chênh tơk Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi kah têêng iêm lóóm ađêi kala. Palâh lóóiq, kơi rau ơi bâân xaraq: “Nôôq paraaq tóh taaiq ưng nôôq manưih kađiq tamôôp Ađó ơi n'toh lóóiq dhiq akóón.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Tââq n'nal mơ bơk rau ơi bâân xaraq lóóiq n'loom hei nek ơi bâân xaraq lóóiq taai rau pató pachóóm đóng chênh nôôq he, hơq đóng đươi rau jruôn parngau lơq đươi rau têêng tabhơơl ưng Bha-aar Yaang Pleng, nôôq he ve bâân lóóm parââm. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Gavơh nhan Yaang Pleng ưng rau jruôn parngau lơq têêng tabhơơl đóng ơơn leq adhi anó buôn đóng ve markơi mưi lóóm kanóq palơq xóng ađêi ting kơi Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />buôn đóng adhi anó ve chóóm markơi mưi lóóm, tââq mưi bóóp bhi haanh Yaang Pleng, nek Ama ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Kơi achêk, phaai pơh đơơp xóng ađêi, kung kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi pơh đơơp adhi anó, buôn malóóm tơk rau cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Taai aku nhan praaq kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi bâân têêng val kơi dhơn ratơơq ưng dhanuôr đơơp iêt ng'kar ơi taai paraaq dhalam ưng Yaang Pleng, buôn đóng lêi paraaq hươq ưng nôôq abhươp avuôq, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />bơơi nek buôn nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng bhi haanh Yaang Pleng ơi taai lóóm kayô ka-er ưng Ađó. Dhiêp kơi paraaq ơi bâân xaraq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Tââq ađek, akóón e đơơp chanót Ađó dhiq m'pơng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">lơq babóóch chaxuul haanh dhanóók Ađó.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Val ve truuih kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">“Nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, phaai bhuui marhaal palơq lơq dhanuôr Ađó.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Lơq val kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">“Tabhơt nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, phaai bhi haanh Chuôq;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">tabhơt nôôq dhanuôr, phaai babóóch haanh Ađó.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Lơq Ê-saai móón kơơq dyơq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">“Riêh ưng Je-sê e yuur vaaih, nek Yaang bâân tahayuur buôn kadhâng akoq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">Nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng e ve lóóm rââm dhiq Ađó.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Rââm Yaang Pleng ưng rau lóóm rââm têêng adhi anó bhlaai bing dyóp rau bhuui marhaal lơq yươq rauha kalóóng lóóm huuiq, buôn têêng đóng adhi anó xưa bhlaai kalóóng rau lóóm rââm đươi karơ mataai ưng Chuôq Yaang Liêm.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Mat lââng, nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, chênh aku kala kung bâân xâng alua leq adhi anó kơi chênh adhi anó kung bâân bing xưa rau liêm kre, taai ơi bâân buur bing dyóp tabech n'nal, lơq ve mapraan buôn bhơơl tapachóóm móón xóng ađêi. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Bơơi aku ơi xaraq kơi nhóól lóóm đóng adhi anó bơk lơh kalóóng dhiq ađô dhiq tôôh kơi buôn móón pahei adhi anó, tââq ơơn phươk liêm ơi bâân Yaang Pleng đóng leq aku, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />buôn têêng aku nek mưi dhơn ratơơq ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih đóng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, xók yuur têêng tarnêêng kadhâng bhanuôih đóng Taruuih Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, hơq đóng bhanuôih ưng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng ve chóóm bâân bhuui lóóm pơh đơơp, tââq bhêêl bâân sek tabah tââq Chuôq Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Taai ađek, kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, aku ve rau pajơơr ađêi ting kơi palơq nôôq tarnêêng mađó leq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Taai aku e kah khin móón mak rau dhơ dharau hơq tarnêêng ađek eh rau Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi yuur têêng dhiq aku, buôn đââng tơk rau xâng bóóp ưng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng tââq paraaq praaq palơq tarnêêng têêng, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />palơq praan karơ ưng nôôq mataai chrih, lơq raman chrih, palơq karơ mataai Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng — tơk mơ aku ơi truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih kơi bing dyóp tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem lơq ving praang đóng tơk leq I-li-ri; <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />hơq ting kơi ađek, bhiêk tabhlơng palơq malóóch kiêng truuih đuui Taruuih liêm eh rau pa-ô dhiq Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi bâân dhaloong gavơh, hơq đóng aku óóq hayuur kadhơng ganơơm dhiq bhanơn ưng manưih lââng. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Dhơ kơi ađek, dhiêp kơi rau ơi bâân xaraq:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 15:21">“Nôôq manưih kah bâân truuih đuui leq Ađó nek e lêi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 15:21">lơq nôôq manưih kah glêh xâng nek e n'nal.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Kơi achêk, bơk chu aku kung ơi bâân takajơq buôn tơk palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Bơơi xók ađôk, taai kah dyơq ve dhiq kalóóng nôôq parah ađôk, hơq taai gamang karaang lóóm rââm mamââk tơk tham adhi anó tââq bơk kamó, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />đóng hayơq hơq xók bhêêl aku vôôiq kalơng tơk Têi Baan Nha, aku alua rââm, xók vôôiq kóh lalơh, lum adhi anó, lơq bâân adhi anó poor jóói tơk ađek, la laloom tââm aku bâân iêm lóóm palơq adhi anó kalóóng n'jang đươnh. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Hayơq xók ađôk aku xók dhiq kalơng vôôiq tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem poor jóói nôôq manưih đu huuiq. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Taai manưih Ma-xê-đoan lơq A-chaai ơi bhuui lóóm yuur têêng mưi ganhuh achêk pagoop achêk đóng nôôq manưih ngeeo ha-ul m'pơng kalóóng nôôq manưih huuiq liêm dhiq kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Taai piđó ơi bhuui lóóm lơq piđó nek nôôq manưih manơơq nôôq manưih achêk. Ơi la nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng bâân ting đơơp nôôq ơơn phươk liêm ưng nôôq manưih achêk, nek piđó kung ve pâng tarnêêng têêng yaauq nôôq manưih achêk leq hót chana tarmông. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Kơi achêk, xók ơi têêng paxong tarnêêng ađô lơq panhơm kaliim kliim pagoop ađô tơk palơq piđó, nek aku e yuur vôôiq kóh hót adhi anó buôn tơk Têi Baan Nha. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Hơq aku n'nal kơi xók tơk palơq adhi anó, aku e tơk palơq rau bing dyóp ơơn phươk ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Mat lââng, adhi anó ơơi, tââq Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq tââq lóóm nh'nhơr ưng Yaang Liêm, aku mââl nhan adhi anó chadrươh ting tarjơl palơq aku palơq nôôq paraaq gavơh nhan klóóih đóng aku malóóm leq Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />buôn aku ve chóóm bâân paq jóói lơh tââq nôôq manưih kah xâng bóóp dhiq Ju-đê, lơq buôn tarnêêng parvôôiq ưng aku đóng leq Jê-ru-sa-leem ve chóóm bâân bhuui lóóm pơh đơơp tââq nôôq manưih huuiq liêm; <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />buôn đóng tââq karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng, aku ve chóóm tơk palơq adhi anó kalóóng rau bhuui marhaal, taai bâân khe khưưi nek palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Gavơh nhan Yaang Pleng yươq rauha tơơt palơq tabhơt adhi anó. A-meen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Lơh ađek, aku nek kayua palơq adhi anó, anó Phê-bê, manưih adhi anó ưng nôôq yi, kung nek manưih têêng yaauq ưng Akóón Dhơn Chuôq dhiq Xeen-kơ-rê, <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />buôn adhi anó ve chóóm pơh yaauq ađó kalóóng Chuôq, ting kơi chóóm đaang palơq nôôq manưih huuiq liêm, lơq tơk tóór poor jóói ađó kalóóng rau hauhiq ađek hơq ađó kơng tơk adhi anó. Taai ađó kung ơi val kơi manưih poor jóói đóng bơk ngaai, payaap tabhơt lơq chênh nek aku.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Nhan chap yayar Bê-rit-siin lơq A-kui-la, nôôq parjơơk marau tarnêêng ưng aku kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />achêk nek nôôq manưih ơi boh parhââm ađêi ơi taai parhââm mamông ưng aku, eh chapiên mưi aku ma-ơơn piđó, hơq tabhơt nôôq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq ưng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng dyơq, <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />lơq chap yayar Akóón Dhơn Chuôq dhiq đong piđó. Nhan chap yayar Ê-baai-nêêt adhi anó bơk nh'nhơr ưng aku, hơq anó achêk nek pale tââp bóóng ưng xưưq A-si đóng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Nhan chap yayar Ma-ri, manưih ơi têêng tarnêêng lóng nhưh nhok taai adhi anó. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Nhan chap yayar An-trô-ni-kơ lơq Ju-ni-a, manưih kabhuh xóng ưng aku lơq parjơơk tơơt đong kanam ưng aku, bơơr chanak achêk nek nôôq manưih tââm tarhaanh kalóóng m'pơng nôôq sưưq-đô, hơq piđó kung ơi tơơt kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih laloom aku. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Nhan chap yayar Am-li-a, parjơơk nh'nhơr bhlơng ưng aku kalóóng Chuôq. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Nhan chap yayar U-rơ-benh, parjơơk mađó tarnêêng ưng nôôq yi kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq Êch-ta-chi, parjơơk nh'nhơr bhlơng ưng aku. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Nhan chap yayar A-be-lơ, manưih bâân pơh đơơp kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih. Nhan chap yayar nôôq manưih ưng parlóng đong A-rich-tô-bu. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Nhan chap yayar Hê-rô-đi-ôôn, manưih kabhuh xóng aku. Nhan chap yayar nôôq ngaai ưng parlóng đong ưng Naat-xiit, nek nôôq manưih tơơt kalóóng Chuôq. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Nhan chap yayar Tri-phe-nơ, lơq Tri-phô-sơ, nôôq manưih hadhơơp nhok kalóóng Chuôq. Nhan chap yayar Beet-si-đơ nh'nhơr bhlơng, manưih ơi têêng tarnêêng lóng nhok gleh kalóóng Chuôq. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Nhan chap yayar Ru-phu, manưih bâân chââih kalóóng Chuôq, palơq akan ưng ađó achêk, lơq ưng aku. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Nhan chap yayar A-sin-cơ-rich, Phơ-lê-gôôn, Heet-me, Ba-trô-ba, Heet-ma, lơq nôôq adhi anó tơơt palơq piđó. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Nhan chap yayar Phi-lô-lô-gơ lơq Ju-li, Nê-rê lơq mamóóq ađó achêk, palơq Ô-liim lơq tabhơt nôôq manưih huuiq liêm tơơt palơq piđó. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Phaai pakah lóóm bhi chap lơq xóng ađêi palơq chanum chum liêm. Tabhơt nôôq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih chap yayar tamóh tham adhi anó.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Mat lââng, adhi anó ơơi, aku mââl bhơơl adhi anó, chamet lêi palơq nôôq manưih têêng tavaaih rau têêng tablah lơq têêng môôp lơt, lơt palơq paraaq pachóóm hơq adhi anó ơi hok, lơq Phaai n'đóch changaai lơh tââq piđó. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Taai nôôq manưih kơi achêk kah đơơp xâng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, bơơi nek beq luônh ưng chênh ađêi, lơq tââq paraaq moor mêêm lơq praaq paliêm bóóp, piđó galơơk chachââr tabhlơng nôôq luônh lóóm đâh xâng. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Tââq lóóm huuiq xâng ưng adhi anó ơi yuur chavó tơk dyóp ngaai. Taai ađek aku bhuui marhaal leq adhi anó, bơơi aku kiêng adhi anó bâân tabech galang leq rau liêm, hơq sek tabah ting kơi palơq rau aak. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Yaang Pleng ưng yươq rauha e kadhaat đâq Sa-taan raal dyung adhi anó kơi đâh bhlơng.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Nhan ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, tơơt palơq adhi anó.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Ti-mô-thê, parjơơk mađó tarnêêng ưng aku, palơq Lu-si-uut, Ja-sôôn, lơq Sô-xi-ba-tê, nôôq manưih kabhuh xóng ưng aku, pagơơi paraaq chap yayar adhi anó. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Aku Teet-tiiu, manưih xaraq bha-aar ađôk, pagơơi paraaq chap yayar adhi anó kalóóng Chuôq. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gaai-uut, manưih pơh yaauq aku lơq tabhơt Akóón Dhơn Chuôq, pagơơi paraaq chap yayar adhi anó. Ê-ra-tu, jư jêên ưng kanóón manưih bơk, nek palơq manưih adhi anó Kua-tu, pagơơi paraaq chap yayar adhi anó. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />[Rââm ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq nôôq he nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih tơơt palơq tabhơt adhi anó. Chêk kơi].<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Rââm cha-iil tabah pachô leq Yaang ve chóóm têêng adhi anó mưng karơ ting Taruuih Liêm ưng aku lơq rau truuih đuui Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, ting rau tapakah leq rau lalââp glêh bâân jư palââp kalóóng bhluuch ganah đươnh bhluuch dhiq bơk klaang đơơi, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />bơơi ađôk ơi bâân gluh pakah, chadrươh ađek tââq nôôq bha-aar manưih loom đââng taruuih, ting paraaq kayua ưng Yaang Pleng tơk nh'chró, ơi bâân truuih karơ đóng dyóp dhanuôr buôn malóóm tơk rau ting xâng ưng lóóm huuiq, <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />nhan cha-iil tabah pachô leq Ađó, nek Yaang Pleng tabech galang mưi giêl, đươi Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, đóng patơk nh'chró. Chêk kơi.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>